/* Seviye sınavları ve çalışma bölümü (beta). tools/sinav/build.py ile üretilir; elle düzenleme. */
window.SINAV={"exams":[{"id":"a2-1","t":"Sınav 1","sec":{"R":{"min":40,"parts":[{"k":"R1","nm":"Okuma 1 · Kısa metinler","ti":"Reading Part 1","ins":"Her kısa metni oku ve metnin ne söylediğini en iyi anlatan seçeneği bul.","ty":"mc","q":[{"q":"What does the notice say?","o":["You must pay if you bring books back late.","The library closes on Friday.","Each book costs 20p to borrow."],"a":0,"tg":["detail"],"e":"Geç getirilen kitaplar için günde 20 peni ödenir.","x":"LIBRARY\nPlease return books by Friday.\nLate books cost 20p a day."},{"q":"What is Ella telling her mum?","o":["She wants her mum to collect her at 8.","She will eat dinner at Sara's house.","She is going to cook pizza tonight."],"a":1,"tg":["purpose","will-going-to"],"e":"\"Don't cook for me – we're having pizza\" = akşam yemeğini Sara'larda yiyecek. Onu Sara'nın babası getirecek.","x":"Mum,\nI'm at Sara's house. Her dad will drive me home at 8. Don't cook for me – we're having pizza!\nElla"},{"q":"What does the sign say?","o":["The café closes every Monday in August.","You can go to the café on 15th August.","The café is closed for the whole of August."],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"Kafe 1–14 Ağustos kapalı; 15 Ağustos pazartesi yeniden açık.","x":"CAFÉ\nClosed for holidays 1st – 14th August.\nOpen again on Monday 15th."},{"q":"What has changed?","o":["the time of the match","the day of the match","the place of the match"],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"Maç cumartesiden pazara alındı; saat aynı.","x":"Hi Tom,\nThe football match is now on Sunday, not Saturday, because the pitch is too wet. Same time – 10 o'clock.\nCoach Ben"},{"q":"What does the notice say?","o":["Students don't need to take a drink.","Students will get lunch at the zoo.","Students can buy food at the zoo."],"a":0,"tg":["inference","must-have-to-should"],"e":"\"Drinks will be provided\" = içecek verilecek, getirmeye gerek yok. Öğle yemeğini öğrenciler kendisi getirmeli.","x":"SCHOOL TRIP TO THE ZOO\nStudents must bring a packed lunch.\nDrinks will be provided."},{"q":"Why is the person selling the bike?","o":["It is in bad condition.","It is too small for their child.","They have bought a new one."],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"\"Too small for my son now\" = oğluna küçük geliyor.","x":"FOR SALE\nBoy's bike, 2 years old, good condition. Too small for my son now. £40.\nCall 07700 900123 after 6 p.m."}]},{"k":"R2","nm":"Okuma 2 · Kişi eşleştirme","ti":"Reading Part 2","ins":"Üç metni oku. Her soru için doğru kişiyi (A, B ya da C) seç. Bir kişi birden fazla kez seçilebilir.","ty":"match","pl":"Tatil yazıları","opts":[["A","Lucy","Every summer my family goes camping by a lake in the mountains. We sleep in a tent, and I share it with my older sister. In the mornings we go swimming, even though the water is really cold! There's no internet there, which I didn't like at first, but now I enjoy reading books instead. My favourite part is cooking dinner on a fire in the evening."],["B","Mark","Last year we went to Rome for a week. We stayed in a hotel in the city centre, so we walked everywhere. I loved the old buildings and the food – I ate ice cream every day! It was very hot, so in the afternoons we went back to the hotel and slept. I'd like to go back one day, but first I want to learn some Italian."],["C","Ana","My grandparents live on a farm, and I spend every August with them. I help my grandfather with the animals – we've got cows, chickens and two horses. I learned to ride a horse this year. My friends think it's boring, but I love it because it's so quiet. The only thing I don't like is getting up at six o'clock every morning!"]],"q":[{"q":"Who shares a tent with a family member?","a":"A","tg":["detail"],"e":"Lucy çadırı ablasıyla paylaşıyor."},{"q":"Who learned to do something new this year?","a":"C","tg":["detail","past-simple"],"e":"Ana bu yıl ata binmeyi öğrendi."},{"q":"Who couldn't use the internet on holiday?","a":"A","tg":["detail"],"e":"Lucy: \"There's no internet there\"."},{"q":"Who wants to study a language?","a":"B","tg":["detail"],"e":"Mark önce biraz İtalyanca öğrenmek istiyor."},{"q":"Who has to get up very early?","a":"C","tg":["detail"],"e":"Ana her sabah 6'da kalkıyor."},{"q":"Who went everywhere on foot?","a":"B","tg":["inference"],"e":"Mark otel şehir merkezinde olduğu için her yere yürüdü."},{"q":"Who says that other people don't like this kind of holiday?","a":"C","tg":["attitude"],"e":"Ana: \"My friends think it's boring\"."}]},{"k":"R3","nm":"Okuma 3 · Uzun metin","ti":"Reading Part 3","ins":"Metni oku ve soruları cevapla.","ty":"mc","title":"My brother the chef","p":["My brother Daniel is twenty-two and he works as a chef in a busy restaurant in Manchester. When he was at school, he wasn't very interested in cooking. He wanted to be a footballer, and he played for the school team every weekend.","Everything changed when he was sixteen. He broke his leg in a match and had to stay at home for two months. He was bored, so he started watching cooking programmes on TV. Then he began making dinner for the family. At first his food wasn't very good, but he got better quickly.","After school, Daniel went to college and studied cooking for two years. It was hard work, and he often had to start at seven in the morning. But he loved it, and his teachers said he was one of the best students in his class.","Now Daniel works five days a week, usually in the evenings. He doesn't have much free time, but he says he's never been happier. His dream is to open his own small restaurant by the sea. I hope he does – then I can eat there for free!"],"q":[{"q":"What did Daniel want to be when he was at school?","o":["a chef","a footballer","a teacher"],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"\"He wanted to be a footballer\"."},{"q":"Why did Daniel start cooking?","o":["He had nothing to do at home.","His mother asked him to help.","He wanted to be on TV."],"a":0,"tg":["inference"],"e":"Bacağı kırıldı, evde canı sıkıldı; yemek programları izleyip yemek yapmaya başladı."},{"q":"What does the writer say about Daniel's first meals?","o":["They were excellent.","Nobody wanted to eat them.","They weren't very good."],"a":2,"tg":["detail"],"e":"\"At first his food wasn't very good\"."},{"q":"What was Daniel's college course like?","o":["It was difficult, but he enjoyed it.","It finished at seven every evening.","It was easy for him."],"a":0,"tg":["detail"],"e":"\"hard work ... But he loved it\". Saat 7 başlama saati, bitiş değil."},{"q":"What would Daniel like to do in the future?","o":["work fewer days","open a restaurant","cook for his brother"],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"\"His dream is to open his own small restaurant by the sea\"."}]},{"k":"R4","nm":"Okuma 4 · Çoktan seçmeli boşluk","ti":"Reading Part 4","ins":"Metni oku ve her boşluk için doğru kelimeyi seç.","ty":"cloze","title":"The giant panda","p":"Giant pandas live in the mountains of China. They (1) ______ most of the day eating bamboo – up to 14 hours! A baby panda is very small when it is born, about the (2) ______ size as a mouse. Pandas usually live (3) ______ their own, but mothers stay with their babies for about two years. There (4) ______ only about 1,800 pandas in the wild today, but the number is growing. Scientists (5) ______ hard to protect them, and many people visit zoos (6) ______ see these beautiful animals.","o":[[["use","spend","take"],1,["collocation"]],[["like","equal","same"],2,["vocab"]],[["on","by","in"],0,["vocab"]],[["is","are","has"],1,["there-is-are"]],[["are working","works","is work"],0,["present-continuous"]],[["for","so","to"],2,["gerund-infinitive"]]],"e":["spend time doing: zaman geçirmek.","the same size as: ile aynı boyda.","live on their own: kendi başlarına yaşamak.","There are + çoğul (pandas).","Şu sıralar süren eylem: are working.","Amaç: to + fiil (to see)."]},{"k":"R5","nm":"Okuma 5 · Açık boşluk","ti":"Reading Part 5","ins":"Metni oku ve her boşluğa TEK kelime yaz.","ty":"open","one":true,"title":"Hi Sam","p":"Hi Sam,\nThanks (1) ______ your message. I'm sorry I didn't reply yesterday – I was very busy. My cousins came to stay with us (2) ______ the weekend. We went to the beach on Saturday and it (3) ______ really sunny. On Sunday we visited a museum. It was (4) ______ interesting than I thought! Are you free next week? (5) ______ you like to come to the cinema with me? There's a new film that I really want (6) ______ see.\nLove,\nMia","a":[["for"],["for","at","over"],["was"],["more"],["would"],["to"]],"tg":[["vocab"],["prepositions-in-on-at"],["past-simple"],["comparatives-superlatives"],["question-words"],["gerund-infinitive"]],"e":["Thanks for: ... için teşekkürler.","for / at / over the weekend: hafta sonu için / boyunca.","Geçmiş zaman: it was sunny.","Uzun sıfat karşılaştırma: more interesting than.","Kibar davet: Would you like to ...?","want to + fiil."]}]},"L":{"min":30,"parts":[{"k":"L1","nm":"Dinleme 1 · Kısa konuşmalar","ti":"Listening Part 1","ins":"Beş kısa konuşma dinleyeceksin. Her soru için doğru cevabı seç.","ty":"mc","q":[{"id":"l1a","sc":[["F","Shall we go to the cinema tonight? The film starts at seven fifteen."],["M","Seven fifteen? I don't finish work until seven. Is there a later one?"],["F","Yes, there's one at eight forty-five."],["M","OK, let's go to that one."]],"q":"What time will they see the film?","o":["7.15","7.00","8.45"],"a":2,"tg":["spelling","detail"],"e":"7.15 erken; 8.45'teki seansa gidecekler."},{"id":"l1b","sc":[["F","I need a present for my brother. He likes music, but he's got lots of CDs."],["M","What about a T-shirt?"],["F","He's got lots of those too. Oh, I know – headphones! His old ones are broken."]],"q":"What will the girl buy for her brother?","o":["headphones","a CD","a T-shirt"],"a":0,"tg":["detail"],"e":"CD ve tişörtü çok var; kulaklık alacak."},{"id":"l1c","sc":[["M","Sorry I'm late. My car wouldn't start this morning."],["F","Oh no. Did you take the bus?"],["M","No, it was too crowded, so I walked. It took forty minutes!"]],"q":"How did the man get to work today?","o":["on foot","by car","by bus"],"a":0,"tg":["detail"],"e":"Araba çalışmadı, otobüs kalabalıktı; yürüdü."},{"id":"l1d","sc":[["M","Mum, have you seen my phone? It's not in my bag."],["F","Did you look on the kitchen table?"],["M","Yes, it's not there."],["F","Oh, here it is. It's on the sofa, under your jacket."]],"q":"Where is the boy's phone?","o":["in his bag","on the sofa","on the kitchen table"],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"Telefon kanepede, ceketin altında."},{"id":"l1e","sc":[["F","It's raining again today. What about tomorrow?"],["M","The forecast says it'll be cloudy in the morning, but sunny in the afternoon."],["F","Good, we can play tennis after lunch then."]],"q":"What will the weather be like tomorrow afternoon?","o":["rainy","sunny","cloudy"],"a":1,"tg":["detail","will-going-to"],"e":"Sabah bulutlu, öğleden sonra güneşli."}]},{"k":"L2","nm":"Dinleme 2 · Not tamamlama","ti":"Listening Part 2","ins":"Bir kayıt dinleyeceksin. Her boşluğa bir kelime, sayı ya da tarih yaz.","ty":"open","id":"l2","title":"Notlar","sc":[["F","Hello, this is Riverside Sports Centre. Thank you for asking about our children's swimming lessons. The lessons are on Wednesdays. We used to have them on Mondays, but not any more. They start at half past four and finish at a quarter past five. The teacher is Mrs Barker – that's B, A, R, K, E, R. She's very friendly and she has taught swimming for twenty years. Ten lessons cost forty-five pounds. Please remember that children must bring a towel and a swimming hat. Thank you for calling."]],"p":"Riverside Sports Centre – children's swimming lessons\nDay: (1) ______\nTime: 4.30 to (2) ______ p.m.\nTeacher's name: Mrs (3) ______\nPrice for 10 lessons: £(4) ______\nBring: a towel and a swimming (5) ______","a":[["Wednesday","Wednesdays"],["5.15","5:15","quarter past five","a quarter past five"],["Barker"],["45","forty-five","forty five"],["hat"]],"tg":[["detail"],["spelling"],["spelling"],["spelling"],["detail"]],"e":["Dersler çarşamba; pazartesi eskiden yapılıyordu.","\"finish at a quarter past five\" = 5.15.","Harf harf söylendi: B-A-R-K-E-R.","\"Ten lessons cost forty-five pounds\".","Havlu ve yüzme bonesi (swimming hat)."]},{"k":"L3","nm":"Dinleme 3 · Uzun konuşma","ti":"Listening Part 3","ins":"İki kişinin konuşmasını dinle ve soruları cevapla.","ty":"mc","id":"l3","sc":[["F","Tom, it's Dad's fiftieth birthday next Saturday. Shall we plan a surprise party for him?"],["M","Great idea, Kate. Where shall we have it? At home?"],["F","Our house is too small for everyone. What about the Italian restaurant in town? Dad loves it."],["M","Hmm, it's very expensive. Grandma's garden is big, and it's free."],["F","You're right. Let's ask Grandma. How many people shall we invite?"],["M","Well, there's the family – that's about fifteen people – and some of Dad's friends from work. Maybe thirty altogether."],["F","OK. And what about food? I can make a cake."],["M","You always make chocolate cake. Dad prefers lemon."],["F","Fine, I'll make a lemon cake. You can buy the drinks."],["M","OK. And Mum can bring some sandwiches. What present shall we get him?"],["F","He wants a new watch, but they cost too much. How about a book about fishing? He's just started going fishing."],["M","Perfect. I'll buy it tomorrow."]],"q":[{"q":"Where will the party be?","o":["at their house","at a restaurant","in their grandmother's garden"],"a":2,"tg":["detail"],"e":"Ev küçük, restoran pahalı; büyükannenin bahçesi."},{"q":"How many people will come to the party?","o":["about fifteen","about thirty","about fifty"],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"Aile yaklaşık 15 kişi, iş arkadaşlarıyla toplam 30. Elli, babanın yaşı."},{"q":"What kind of cake will Kate make?","o":["lemon","chocolate","strawberry"],"a":0,"tg":["detail"],"e":"Babaları limonlu pastayı tercih ediyor."},{"q":"What will Tom bring to the party?","o":["sandwiches","the drinks","the cake"],"a":1,"tg":["detail","will-going-to"],"e":"\"You can buy the drinks\" – içecekleri Tom alacak. Sandviçleri anne getirecek."},{"q":"What present will they buy?","o":["a book about fishing","a new watch","a fishing rod"],"a":0,"tg":["detail"],"e":"Saat çok pahalı; balıkçılık kitabı alacaklar."}]},{"k":"L4","nm":"Dinleme 4 · Kısa kayıtlar","ti":"Listening Part 4","ins":"Beş kısa kayıt dinleyeceksin. Her soru için doğru cevabı seç.","ty":"mc","q":[{"id":"l4a","sc":[["F","Hello, this is Anna Cole. I bought a lamp from your shop on Saturday, but when I got home, I found it didn't work. Can I bring it back and change it for a new one?"]],"q":"Why is the woman calling?","o":["to buy a lamp","to change something she bought","to ask about opening times"],"a":1,"tg":["purpose"],"e":"Aldığı lamba çalışmıyor; yenisiyle değiştirmek istiyor."},{"id":"l4b","sc":[["M","Everyone said the trip to the castle would be boring, but I thought it was brilliant. The guide told us lots of funny stories, and we dressed up in old clothes."]],"q":"How did the boy feel about the school trip?","o":["He thought it was boring.","He enjoyed it a lot.","He thought it was too long."],"a":1,"tg":["attitude"],"e":"\"I thought it was brilliant\" – çok beğendi. Sıkıcı diyenler başkaları."},{"id":"l4c","sc":[["F","OK, everyone, before you go home, please remember that the history homework is due on Thursday, not Friday. And don't forget to bring your sports clothes tomorrow."]],"q":"What is the teacher mainly talking about?","o":["when to give in homework","a history test on Friday","a new sports club"],"a":0,"tg":["gist"],"e":"Tarih ödevinin perşembe teslim edileceğini hatırlatıyor."},{"id":"l4d","sc":[["M","My new flat isn't very big, and the kitchen is quite old. But from the living room window, I can see the whole city and the river. That's the best thing about it."]],"q":"What does the man like most about his new flat?","o":["the size","the kitchen","the view"],"a":2,"tg":["detail"],"e":"\"That's the best thing about it\" = manzara."},{"id":"l4e","sc":[["M","Can you see the screen OK?"],["F","Yes, but the people in front are talking. And this popcorn is too salty!"],["M","Shh, it's starting."]],"q":"Where are the speakers?","o":["at a cinema","in a classroom","at a restaurant"],"a":0,"tg":["inference"],"e":"Perde (screen), patlamış mısır, \"it's starting\": sinema."}]},{"k":"L5","nm":"Dinleme 5 · Eşleştirme","ti":"Listening Part 5","ins":"Bir konuşma dinleyeceksin. Her kişiyi doğru seçenekle (A–H) eşleştir. Üç seçenek fazladır.","ty":"match","id":"l5","sc":[["F","So, Ben, what are your friends doing in the holidays?"],["M","Well, Sam's going to work in his uncle's shop. He wants to save money for a new bike."],["F","Good for him. What about Lily? Is she going camping again?"],["M","No, not this year. She's going to stay with her grandparents in Scotland."],["F","That's nice. And Josh?"],["M","Josh is doing a cooking course. He wants to be a chef one day."],["F","Really? And Emma? She loves the beach, doesn't she?"],["M","Yes, but she's broken her arm, so she can't swim. She's going to paint her bedroom instead. Her mum said she can choose the colours!"],["F","With one arm? And Ryan?"],["M","Ryan's having tennis lessons every morning. He's really good already."]],"opts":[["A","going camping"],["B","doing a cooking course"],["C","visiting family"],["D","working in a shop"],["E","learning to swim"],["F","painting"],["G","playing tennis"],["H","going to the beach"]],"q":[{"q":"Sam","a":"D","tg":["detail"],"e":"Amcasının dükkânında çalışacak."},{"q":"Lily","a":"C","tg":["detail"],"e":"Bu yıl kamp yok; İskoçya'da büyükanne ve büyükbabasında kalacak."},{"q":"Josh","a":"B","tg":["detail"],"e":"Aşçılık kursuna gidiyor."},{"q":"Emma","a":"F","tg":["detail","inference"],"e":"Kolu kırık, yüzemiyor; odasını boyayacak."},{"q":"Ryan","a":"G","tg":["detail"],"e":"Her sabah tenis dersi alıyor."}]}]},"W":{"min":20,"tasks":[{"id":"a2x-w1","part":6,"t":"Part 6 · E-posta: Parka gitmek","in":"You want to go to the park with your English friend Alex on Saturday. Write an email to Alex. In your email:\n• suggest going to the park\n• say what time to meet\n• say what you can do there.\nWrite 25 words or more.","mail":"To: Alex\nSubject: Saturday","pts":[["Parka gitmeyi öner",["park","shall we","let's","would you like","do you want"]],["Buluşma saati söyle",["o'clock","at 1","at 2","at 3","at 4","at 9","at 10","at 11","half past","meet at","a.m","p.m"]],["Orada ne yapabileceğinizi söyle",["play","football","picnic","ride","walk","frisbee","swim","tennis","basketball"]]],"min":25,"max":60,"model":"Hi Alex,\nWould you like to go to the park with me on Saturday? Let's meet at the park gate at 11 o'clock. We can play football and then have a picnic by the lake.\nSee you,\nEmre"},{"id":"a2x-w2","part":7,"kind":"story","t":"Part 7 · Resimli hikâye: Kırık cam","in":"Look at the three pictures. Write the story shown in the pictures.\nWrite 35 words or more.","mail":"Picture 1: 👦⚽🌳  (Bir çocuk parkta futbol oynuyor.)\nPicture 2: ⚽💥🪟  (Top bir evin camına çarpıp kırıyor.)\nPicture 3: 👦🙇👵🍪  (Çocuk özür diliyor; yaşlı kadın gülümseyip ona kurabiye veriyor.)","pts":[["Çocuğun futbol oynadığını anlat",["football","ball","played","playing","kicked"]],["Camın kırıldığını anlat",["window","broke","broken","smashed"]],["Özrü ve sonucu anlat",["sorry","apologised","cookie","biscuit","smiled","gave"]],["Geçmiş zaman kullan",["was","went","played","kicked","broke","said","gave"]]],"min":35,"max":80,"model":"Last Saturday, Leo was playing football in the park near his house. He kicked the ball very hard and it flew over the fence. It broke the window of an old woman's house! Leo felt terrible, so he knocked on her door and said sorry. The woman smiled and gave him a cookie."}]},"S":{"parts":[{"id":"a2x-s1","p":1,"t":"Part 1 · Tanışma","ins":"Sınav görevlisi seninle ilgili sorular soruyor. Kısa ama tam cümlelerle cevap ver; son sorularda biraz daha uzun konuş.","q":[["What's your name? How old are you?",15,["my name is","I'm","years old"],"My name is Elif and I'm fifteen years old."],["Where do you live?",15,["I live in","it's"],"I live in Bursa. It's a big city in the north-west of Turkey."],["Tell me about your family.",30,["there are","I have","I've got","my mother","my father","brother","sister"],"There are four people in my family: my mother, my father, my little brother and me. My mother is a nurse and my father works in a bank. My brother is eight and he loves football."],["What do you like doing at the weekend?",30,["I like","I usually","with my friends","because"],"At the weekend I usually meet my friends. We go to the shopping centre or watch films. I also like playing basketball because it's fun and good for my health."],["Please tell me about your favourite place in your town.",30,["my favourite","because","there is","you can"],"My favourite place is the big park near my house. There is a lake and lots of trees. I go there with my dog every evening because it's quiet and beautiful."]]},{"id":"a2x-s2","p":2,"t":"Part 2 · Resimlerle konuşma","ins":"Gerçek sınavda bu bölüm bir partnerle yapılır. Burada resimlerdeki etkinlikler hakkında kendi görüşünü söyle.","opts":["🏊 swimming","🎮 video games","📚 reading","🚲 cycling","🎸 playing music"],"q":[["Here are some pictures of different things to do in your free time. Do you like these different things? Say why or why not.",60,["I like","I don't like","because","I think","it's"],"I really like swimming because it's good exercise and I feel relaxed after it. Video games are fun, but I don't play them very often because my eyes get tired. I don't like reading very much – it's a bit boring for me. Cycling is great! I go cycling with my dad on Sundays. Playing music is interesting, but I can't play any instruments."],["Which of these things do you like best? Why?",30,["I like ... best","my favourite","because"],"I like cycling best, because I can do it outside with my friends and see lots of different places."],["Do you prefer doing things alone or with friends? Why?",30,["I prefer","because","with my friends","alone"],"I prefer doing things with my friends, because it's more fun and we can talk and laugh together."],["Do you think it's important to do sport? Why?",30,["I think","yes","because","healthy"],"Yes, I think it's very important, because sport keeps you healthy and you feel happier. It's also a good way to make friends."]]}]}},"lv":"A2","name":"A2 Key"},{"id":"b1-1","t":"Sınav 1","sec":{"R":{"min":45,"parts":[{"k":"R1","nm":"Okuma 1 · Kısa metinler","ti":"Reading Part 1","ins":"Her kısa metni oku ve metnin ne söylediğini en iyi anlatan seçeneği bul.","ty":"mc","q":[{"x":"NOTICE\nSwimming pool closed for cleaning on Monday morning. Lessons will start at 2 p.m. instead of 10 a.m.","q":"What does the notice say?","o":["Swimming lessons are cancelled on Monday.","Monday's swimming lessons will take place later than usual.","The pool will be cleaned every Monday morning."],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"Dersler iptal edilmiyor, sabah 10 yerine öğleden sonra 2'de başlıyor: yani her zamankinden geç."},{"x":"Hi Tom,\nI've left the keys with Mrs Hill next door because I'll be back late tonight. Please don't forget to feed the cat!\nAnna","q":"Why has Anna written this message?","o":["to tell Tom where he can find the keys","to ask Tom to collect the cat from Mrs Hill","to explain why she forgot the keys"],"a":0,"tg":["purpose","present-perfect"],"e":"\"I've left the keys with Mrs Hill\" anahtarların nerede olduğunu söylüyor. Kedi Mrs Hill'de değil; Tom'dan kediyi beslemesi isteniyor."},{"x":"SALE\nAll winter coats half price this week only. Cards accepted, but not for items under £5.","q":"What does this sign say?","o":["You can only pay in cash this week.","Winter coats are cheaper for a short time.","Coats under £5 are not in the sale."],"a":1,"tg":["detail","vocab"],"e":"\"half price this week only\" = kısa bir süre için yarı fiyat. Kart yalnızca 5 sterlinin altındaki ürünlerde geçmiyor."},{"x":"To: All students\nThe trip to the science museum has been moved from Friday to next Tuesday because the bus company had a problem. Please bring your forms by Monday.","q":"What should students do?","o":["give in their forms before the trip","phone the bus company on Friday","go to the museum on Monday"],"a":0,"tg":["detail","passive-advanced"],"e":"Gezi salıya alındı; formlar pazartesiye kadar, yani geziden önce teslim edilmeli."},{"x":"Lucy, Ben called. He can't meet you at the cinema at 7, but he'll be there by 7.30 if you can wait. Text him to let him know. Mum","q":"What does Ben want Lucy to do?","o":["change the cinema","tell him if she can wait","meet him at 7 o'clock"],"a":1,"tg":["inference","reported-speech"],"e":"\"Text him to let him know\" = bekleyip bekleyemeyeceğini ona haber vermesi isteniyor."}]},{"k":"R2","nm":"Okuma 2 · Eşleştirme","ti":"Reading Part 2","ins":"Aşağıdaki beş kişi bir yaz kursu arıyor. Her kişi için en uygun kursu (A–H) seç.","ty":"match","pl":"Metinler (A–H)","opts":[["A","Weekend Kitchen","Two-day course on Saturday and Sunday. Learn to bake bread and cakes. Everything you make goes home with you in a box."],["B","Sea Kayaking","A five-day course for teenagers who have never kayaked. All equipment is provided. Daily trips along the coast."],["C","Spanish Conversation","Evening classes, Monday to Thursday, maximum six students per group. Speaking only – no grammar homework!"],["D","City Walks","Discover the old town with an expert guide. Each day we visit a castle, a museum or an old market."],["E","Photo Club","For people who already know their camera well. Weekly competitions and discussions about famous photographers."],["F","Camera Basics","Learn every button on your camera in four lessons. The best photos from the group will appear in the library exhibition."],["G","Spanish Grammar","Morning classes for groups of up to twenty. Lots of written exercises to prepare for exams."],["H","Climbing Day","A one-day climbing taster for adults with some experience. Lunch included."]],"q":[{"q":"Maria: Maria wants to improve her cooking. She works during the week, so she can only go at weekends. She would like to take home what she makes.","a":"A","tg":["detail"],"e":"Hafta sonu, yaptığını eve götürme: A."},{"q":"Daniel: Daniel is 16 and loves being outdoors. He wants to try a sport he has never done before, and he would prefer a course that lasts several days.","a":"B","tg":["detail"],"e":"Daha önce yapmadığı bir spor, birkaç gün, gençler: B (H tek gün ve deneyimli yetişkinler için)."},{"q":"Sophie: Sophie is a beginner photographer. She wants to learn to use her new camera and she hopes to have her photos shown somewhere at the end.","a":"F","tg":["detail"],"e":"Yeni başlayan, fotoğraflar sergilenecek: F (E kamerasını iyi bilenler için)."},{"q":"Ahmed: Ahmed wants to practise speaking another language before a trip to Spain. He prefers small groups and evening classes.","a":"C","tg":["detail"],"e":"Konuşma, küçük grup, akşam: C (G sabah ve kalabalık)."},{"q":"Chen: Chen is interested in history. He would like a course with visits to real places rather than just lessons in a classroom.","a":"D","tg":["detail"],"e":"Gerçek yerlere ziyaret: D."}]},{"k":"R3","nm":"Okuma 3 · Uzun metin","ti":"Reading Part 3","ins":"Metni oku ve soruları cevapla.","ty":"mc","title":"My first job","p":["When I was seventeen, I got a summer job at a small hotel by the sea. I had never worked before, and to be honest, I was more interested in the beach than in the money. My parents thought it would be good for me to learn what work was really like.","On my first day, the manager, Mrs Grant, gave me a uniform that was far too big and asked me to clean twenty rooms before lunch. I thought it was impossible. By twelve o'clock I had finished only eight, and I was sure she would be angry. Instead, she sat down with me and showed me a better way to organise my work. \"Everyone is slow at the beginning,\" she said.","After a few weeks, I was much faster, and I started to enjoy talking to the guests. Some of them came back every year and told me stories about the hotel in the past. I also made friends with the other young workers, and we often went swimming together after work.","Looking back, I realise that job taught me more than any school lesson. I learned to be patient, to ask for help when I needed it, and to be proud of doing something well. I still use those lessons today in my job as a teacher."],"q":[{"q":"Why did the writer take the job?","o":["He needed money for university.","His parents encouraged him to work.","He wanted to live near the beach.","A friend already worked at the hotel."],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"\"My parents thought it would be good for me\" – ailesi teşvik etti."},{"q":"How did the writer feel at twelve o'clock on his first day?","o":["proud of what he had done","angry with the manager","worried about the manager's reaction","bored with the work"],"a":2,"tg":["inference","past-perfect"],"e":"\"I was sure she would be angry\" – yöneticinin tepkisinden endişe ediyordu."},{"q":"What did Mrs Grant do?","o":["She gave him an easier job.","She explained how to work more efficiently.","She told him to finish the rooms after lunch.","She gave him a smaller uniform."],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"\"showed me a better way to organise my work\" = daha verimli çalışmayı gösterdi."},{"q":"What did the writer enjoy most after a few weeks?","o":["swimming alone","the guests' stories","cleaning the rooms quickly","working extra hours"],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"Misafirlerle konuşmayı ve onların otelin geçmişiyle ilgili hikâyelerini sevdi."},{"q":"What is the writer's main point in the text?","o":["Hotel work is too difficult for young people.","Teachers should have experience of other jobs.","His first job taught him important lessons for life.","Managers should be kind to new workers."],"a":2,"tg":["gist"],"e":"Son paragraf: o iş ona okul derslerinden daha çok şey öğretti."}]},{"k":"R4","nm":"Okuma 4 · Cümle yerleştirme","ti":"Reading Part 4","ins":"Metinden beş cümle çıkarıldı. Her boşluk için uygun cümleyi (A–H) seç. Üç cümle fazladır.","ty":"gap","title":"The town that gave up cars","p":"Ten years ago, the small town of Lindhaven decided to close its centre to cars. Many shop owners were against the idea. (1) ______ They were worried that customers would stop coming.\nIn the first few months, things were difficult. Some shops did lose business. (2) ______ People began to walk and cycle into town, and they stayed longer because the streets were quieter and cleaner.\nThe town also built a large car park just outside the centre. (3) ______ The bus is free, so people do not mind leaving their cars there.\nToday, Lindhaven has more shops than before. (4) ______ Visitors from other countries come to see how the town changed.\nNot everyone is happy, of course. Older people sometimes find it hard to carry heavy shopping a long way. (5) ______ It seems that most problems can be solved if people are willing to talk.","opts":[["A","But after a year, the situation started to change."],["B","From there, a small bus takes visitors to the main square every ten minutes."],["C","They believed that people would not want to walk."],["D","The town plans to open the centre to cars again next year."],["E","To help them, the town now offers a free delivery service."],["F","Many of them are cafés with tables outside in the street."],["G","The bus stopped running because nobody used it."],["H","Cars are much cheaper to use in the countryside."]],"a":["C","A","B","F","E"],"tg":[["coherence"],["coherence"],["reference"],["coherence"],["reference"]],"e":["\"They were worried...\" öncesinde dükkân sahiplerinin düşüncesi gelmeli: C.","\"did lose business\" sonrası \"But after a year\" ile değişim başlıyor: A.","\"From there\" = otoparktan; sonraki cümlede \"The bus is free\": B.","Daha çok dükkân → \"Many of them are cafés\": F.","Yaşlıların zorluğuna çözüm: \"To help them\": E."]},{"k":"R5","nm":"Okuma 5 · Çoktan seçmeli boşluk","ti":"Reading Part 5","ins":"Metni oku ve her boşluk için doğru kelimeyi seç.","ty":"cloze","title":"A weekend in the mountains","p":"Last weekend my family and I (1) ______ on a trip to the mountains. We had booked a small cabin (2) ______ was next to a lake. On Saturday we got up early and (3) ______ a long walk through the forest. It was quite (4) ______, but the views from the top were amazing. In the evening it started to rain, so we stayed inside and played cards. We enjoyed it so much (5) ______ we have already decided to go back next year. I would (6) ______ it to anyone who loves nature.","o":[[["went","made","did","took"],0,["vocab"]],[["who","which","where","what"],1,["relative-clauses"]],[["went","made","took","did"],2,["vocab"]],[["tiring","tired","tire","tiredness"],0,["vocab"]],[["because","that","so","than"],1,["linkers-contrast-purpose"]],[["advise","recommend","tell","say"],1,["reporting-verbs"]]],"e":["go on a trip: geziye çıkmak.","Şey (cabin) için which; arkasından fiil geliyor.","take a walk: yürüyüşe çıkmak.","Yürüyüş yorucuydu: tiring (yorucu). tired = yorgun (kişi).","so ... that: o kadar ... ki.","recommend something to someone: birine bir şeyi tavsiye etmek. advise ve tell bu kalıpla kullanılmaz."]},{"k":"R6","nm":"Okuma 6 · Açık boşluk","ti":"Reading Part 6","ins":"Metni oku ve her boşluğa TEK kelime yaz.","ty":"open","title":"Hi Jess!","p":"Hi Jess!\nI'm writing (1) ______ tell you about my new school. I started here two weeks ago and I really like it. The teachers are very friendly and there are lots of clubs. I've already joined the drama club, (2) ______ meets every Wednesday. My best friend here is called Mia. She lives (3) ______ the same street as me, so we walk to school together. The only problem is that the school is (4) ______ bigger than my old one, and I sometimes get lost! Have you ever (5) ______ to a new school? Write back soon and tell me (6) ______ you are doing.\nLove, Ella","a":[["to"],["which"],["on","in"],["much","far","a lot"],["been","gone","moved","changed"],["how","what"]],"tg":[["gerund-infinitive"],["relative-clauses"],["prepositions-in-on-at"],["comparatives-superlatives"],["present-perfect"],["reported-speech"]],"e":["Amaç: to + fiil (I'm writing to tell you).","Virgüllü ek bilgi, şey (club): which.","Sokak adıyla on (İngiltere'de in de kullanılır).","Karşılaştırmayı güçlendirme: much / far / a lot bigger.","Have you ever been to ...? deneyim sorusu (moved / changed da anlamca kabul edilir).","Dolaylı soru: tell me how you are doing (what you are doing da olur)."]}]},"L":{"min":30,"parts":[{"k":"L1","nm":"Dinleme 1 · Kısa kayıtlar","ti":"Listening Part 1","ins":"Yedi kısa kayıt dinleyeceksin. Her soru için doğru cevabı seç.","ty":"mc","q":[{"id":"l1a","sc":[["M","Excuse me, how much is a return ticket to Oxford?"],["F","It's twelve pounds fifty. But if you travel after half past nine, it's only nine pounds twenty."],["M","Oh, I'm leaving at ten, so that's fine."]],"q":"How much will the man pay?","o":["£12.50","£9.20","£9.50"],"a":1,"tg":["detail","spelling"],"e":"Saat 10'da gidiyor; 9.30'dan sonra bilet 9,20 sterlin."},{"id":"l1b","sc":[["F","Did you buy the present for Grandma?"],["M","Yes. I was going to get her a scarf, but she has so many. So I got her a book about gardens instead."],["F","Good idea. She loves her garden."]],"q":"What did the boy buy for his grandmother?","o":["a scarf","a book","some flowers"],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"\"I was going to get her a scarf ... I got her a book\" – sonunda kitap aldı."},{"id":"l1c","sc":[["M","Hi, it's Sam. Sorry, I'll be late for the meeting. My train has been delayed. I think I'll be there by quarter to eleven, not half past ten as we planned."]],"q":"What time will Sam arrive?","o":["10.15","10.30","10.45"],"a":2,"tg":["detail","passive-advanced"],"e":"quarter to eleven = 10.45. 10.30 planlanan saatti."},{"id":"l1d","sc":[["F","What was the weather like on your holiday?"],["M","Well, the first two days were sunny, but then it rained for the rest of the week. We spent most of the time in museums."]],"q":"What was the weather like for most of the holiday?","o":["sunny","rainy","windy"],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"İlk iki gün güneşli, haftanın geri kalanı yağmurlu."},{"id":"l1e","sc":[["M","Where shall we meet tomorrow? At the café?"],["F","It's closed on Sundays. Let's meet outside the station, and we can walk to the park from there."],["M","OK, see you there."]],"q":"Where will they meet?","o":["at the café","at the station","in the park"],"a":1,"tg":["detail","will-going-to"],"e":"Kafe pazar kapalı; istasyonun önünde buluşacaklar."},{"id":"l1f","sc":[["F","Have you finished your project yet?"],["M","Almost. I've written the text and I've found the photos. I just need to print it. The printer at home isn't working, so I'll do it at the library tomorrow."]],"q":"What does the boy still need to do?","o":["write the text","find some photos","print the project"],"a":2,"tg":["detail","present-perfect"],"e":"Metni yazmış, fotoğrafları bulmuş; yalnızca yazdırması kaldı."},{"id":"l1g","sc":[["M","I really want to learn a musical instrument. I tried the guitar last year, but it hurt my fingers. My sister plays the piano, but we haven't got space for one. I think I'll try the violin."]],"q":"Which instrument is the man going to learn?","o":["the guitar","the piano","the violin"],"a":2,"tg":["detail"],"e":"Gitarı denedi, piyanoya yer yok; kemanı deneyecek."}]},{"k":"L2","nm":"Dinleme 2 · Kısa konuşmalar","ti":"Listening Part 2","ins":"Altı kısa konuşma dinleyeceksin. Her soru için doğru cevabı seç.","ty":"mc","q":[{"id":"l2a","sc":[["F","How was the new restaurant?"],["M","The food was lovely, but we waited almost an hour for it. And it was so noisy we could hardly talk."],["F","So you won't go again?"],["M","Probably not."]],"q":"What did the man think of the restaurant?","o":["The food was disappointing.","The service was too slow.","It was too expensive."],"a":1,"tg":["attitude"],"e":"Yemek güzeldi ama neredeyse bir saat beklediler: servis yavaştı."},{"id":"l2b","sc":[["M","Are you enjoying your new job?"],["F","The work is interesting, and my colleagues are nice. It's just that it takes me an hour and a half to get there every morning."],["M","That's a long time."]],"q":"What is the woman's problem with her job?","o":["the journey to work","the people she works with","the type of work"],"a":0,"tg":["attitude"],"e":"İş ilginç, arkadaşlar iyi; sorun her sabah bir buçuk saatlik yol."},{"id":"l2c","sc":[["F","Did you see the film last night?"],["M","Yes. Everyone said it was brilliant, but I thought the story was hard to follow."],["F","Really? I loved it."]],"q":"How did the man feel about the film?","o":["He found it confusing.","He thought it was too long.","He agreed it was brilliant."],"a":0,"tg":["attitude"],"e":"\"the story was hard to follow\" = kafa karıştırıcı buldu."},{"id":"l2d","sc":[["M","I'm thinking of selling my bike."],["F","Why? You use it every day."],["M","I know, but I'm moving to the city centre next month, and I'll be able to walk everywhere."]],"q":"Why does the man want to sell his bike?","o":["It is too old.","He won't need it any more.","He wants a faster one."],"a":1,"tg":["inference","will-going-to"],"e":"Şehir merkezine taşınıp her yere yürüyebilecek: bisiklete ihtiyacı kalmayacak."},{"id":"l2e","sc":[["F","You look tired."],["M","I am. My neighbours had a party last night, and it didn't finish until three. If I had known, I would have stayed at my brother's."]],"q":"Why is the man tired?","o":["He worked late.","He stayed at his brother's.","His neighbours were noisy."],"a":2,"tg":["detail","third-conditional"],"e":"Komşuların partisi sabah üçe kadar sürdü. Kardeşinde kalmadı; \"kalırdım\" diyor (third conditional)."},{"id":"l2f","sc":[["M","Shall we go to the beach on Saturday?"],["F","I'd love to, but I promised to help my mum paint the kitchen. How about Sunday?"],["M","Sunday's fine."]],"q":"What will the woman do on Saturday?","o":["go to the beach","help her mother","paint her own room"],"a":1,"tg":["detail","reporting-verbs"],"e":"Annesine mutfağı boyamada yardım edeceğine söz verdi."}]},{"k":"L3","nm":"Dinleme 3 · Not tamamlama","ti":"Listening Part 3","ins":"Bir müze rehberini dinle. Her boşluğa bir kelime, sayı ya da tarih yaz.","ty":"open","id":"l3","sc":[["F","Good morning, everyone, and welcome to the City Museum. Before you start your visit, here is some useful information. The museum opens at nine thirty every day and closes at five, except on Thursdays, when we stay open until eight in the evening. On the ground floor you will find our main exhibition, which is about the history of the river. On the first floor there is a special exhibition about toys from the last hundred years. Children love it, and so do many adults! Our café is on the top floor. It has great views of the city, and today the special is vegetable soup. Please note that you can take photos everywhere except in the toy exhibition. If you lose anything, go to the information desk next to the main entrance. Finally, don't forget that our free guided tour starts at eleven o'clock from the shop. Enjoy your visit!"]],"title":"Notlar","p":"City Museum\nOpening time: (1) ______\nOn Thursdays open until: (2) ______ p.m.\nGround floor exhibition: the history of the (3) ______\nFirst floor exhibition: (4) ______ from the last 100 years\nToday's special in the café: vegetable (5) ______\nFree guided tour starts from the (6) ______","a":[["9.30","9:30","half past nine","nine thirty"],["8","eight","8.00"],["river"],["toys","toy"],["soup"],["shop"]],"tg":[["spelling"],["spelling"],["detail"],["detail"],["detail"],["detail"]],"e":["\"opens at nine thirty\"","\"until eight in the evening\"","\"the history of the river\"","\"toys from the last hundred years\"","\"today the special is vegetable soup\"","\"starts at eleven o'clock from the shop\""]},{"k":"L4","nm":"Dinleme 4 · Röportaj","ti":"Listening Part 4","ins":"Genç bir dağcıyla yapılan röportajı dinle ve soruları cevapla.","ty":"mc","id":"l4","sc":[["M","Today I'm talking to Emma Price, who, at just nineteen, has climbed some of the highest mountains in Europe. Emma, how did you start?"],["F","Well, my parents loved walking, so we spent every holiday in the hills. When I was twelve, my uncle took me to a climbing wall, and I was hooked. I didn't try a real mountain until I was fifteen."],["M","What's the hardest thing about climbing?"],["F","People think it's being afraid of heights, but actually I've never had that problem. For me, the hardest part is the cold. You have to keep going even when you can't feel your hands."],["M","Do you climb alone?"],["F","Never. It's much safer to climb with a team, and anyway, sharing the experience is half the fun. My climbing partner, Lisa, has been my best friend since school."],["M","How do you prepare for a big climb?"],["F","I go running every morning and I go to the gym three times a week. But I think planning is even more important than fitness. We study the weather and the route for weeks before we go."],["M","And what's next?"],["F","Next summer we're going to try a mountain in South America. I'm excited, but I'm also a bit nervous because it's much higher than anything we've done before."]],"q":[{"q":"When did Emma first climb a real mountain?","o":["when she was twelve","when she was fifteen","when she was nineteen"],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"12 yaşında tırmanma duvarı; gerçek dağ 15 yaşında."},{"q":"What does Emma find most difficult about climbing?","o":["being high up","the low temperatures","carrying heavy bags"],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"Yükseklik korkusu yok; en zor kısım soğuk."},{"q":"Why does Emma prefer to climb with other people?","o":["It is more enjoyable and safer.","Her parents won't let her climb alone.","She is not experienced enough."],"a":0,"tg":["inference"],"e":"\"much safer ... sharing the experience is half the fun\""},{"q":"Who is Lisa?","o":["Emma's sister","Emma's teacher","Emma's friend"],"a":2,"tg":["detail","present-perfect"],"e":"\"has been my best friend since school\""},{"q":"According to Emma, what is the most important part of preparation?","o":["running","going to the gym","planning the trip"],"a":2,"tg":["detail","comparatives-superlatives"],"e":"\"planning is even more important than fitness\""},{"q":"How does Emma feel about her next climb?","o":["only excited","both excited and worried","not sure if she will go"],"a":1,"tg":["attitude","will-going-to"],"e":"\"I'm excited, but I'm also a bit nervous\""}]}]},"W":{"min":45,"tasks":[{"id":"b1x-w1","part":1,"t":"Part 1 · E-posta: İngilizce kulübü","in":"Read this email from your English teacher, Mr Clark, and the notes you have made. Write your email to Mr Clark using all the notes. Write about 100 words.","mail":"From: Mr Clark\nSubject: English club\n\nDear students,\nWe are starting an English club after school this term. [Great idea!]\nWe can meet on Tuesdays or Fridays. Which day is better for you? [Say which and why]\nWhat activities would you like to do in the club? [Suggest ...]\nCould you also help us to tell other students about the club? [Yes, I can ...]\nBest wishes,\nMr Clark","pts":[["Fikri beğendiğini söyle",["great","good idea","love","excited","fantastic","brilliant","sounds"]],["Gün seç ve nedenini söyle",["tuesday","friday"]],["Etkinlik öner",["film","game","play","song","quiz","drama","speak","talk","music","book","debate"]],["Diğer öğrencilere nasıl haber vereceğini söyle",["poster","tell","social media","message","website","class","friends","announce"]]],"min":80,"max":130,"model":"Dear Mr Clark,\nThank you for your email. I think an English club is a great idea, and I would love to join it.\nFriday would be better for me, because I have basketball training on Tuesdays after school. Also, on Fridays we don't have much homework, so everyone will be more relaxed.\nIn the club, we could watch short English films and talk about them. It would also be fun to play quiz games and sing songs together.\nOf course I can help. I could make some posters for the school corridors and send a message to my classmates.\nBest wishes,\nDeniz"},{"choice":[{"id":"b1x-w2","part":2,"kind":"article","t":"Part 2 · Makale: Unutulmaz bir gün","in":"You see this announcement in an English-language magazine. Write your article in about 100 words.","mail":"ARTICLES WANTED!\nA day I will never forget\nTell us about a special day in your life. What happened? Who were you with? Why will you always remember it?\nThe best articles will be published next month.","pts":[["Ne olduğunu anlat",["was","were","went","had","happened","saw"]],["Kiminle olduğunu söyle",["with","friend","family","mother","father","sister","brother","cousin","grandmother","grandfather"]],["Neden unutamayacağını açıkla",["because","never forget","remember","special","reason","so"]],["Bir başlık kullan",["@title"]]],"min":80,"max":140,"model":"My first concert\nThe day I will never forget is the day I saw my favourite band live. It was my fifteenth birthday, and my older sister had bought tickets as a surprise.\nWe travelled to Istanbul by train and arrived at the stadium two hours early. When the band finally came on stage, everyone started singing and dancing. I knew every word of every song!\nI will always remember that day because it was the first time I had been to a concert, and because my sister had planned everything for me. It made me feel really special."},{"id":"b1x-w3","part":2,"kind":"story","t":"Part 2 · Hikâye: Yanlış otobüs","in":"Your English teacher has asked you to write a story. Your story must begin with this sentence. Write your story in about 100 words.","mail":"Your story must begin with this sentence:\nAfter ten minutes on the bus, Maya realised she was going the wrong way.","pts":[["Verilen cümleyle başla",["after ten minutes on the bus"]],["Geçmiş zamanla olayları anlat",["was","were","got","looked","asked","decided","saw"]],["Bir sorun ve çözüm olsun",["but","so","then","luckily","suddenly"]],["Hikâyeyi bitir (sonuç)",["in the end","finally","at last","happy","relieved","laughed","never"]]],"min":80,"max":140,"model":"After ten minutes on the bus, Maya realised she was going the wrong way. She was supposed to be at her friend's birthday party at six, and it was already half past five.\nShe got off at the next stop and looked around. She didn't know the area at all, and her phone battery was almost empty. Luckily, she saw an old man waiting at the bus stop and asked him for help.\n\"Take the number 12,\" he said. \"It goes straight to the city centre.\"\nIn the end, Maya arrived at the party only fifteen minutes late, and she had a funny story to tell everyone."}]}]},"S":{"parts":[{"id":"b1x-s1","p":1,"t":"Part 1 · Tanışma","ins":"Sınav görevlisi seni tanımak için sorular soruyor. Her soruya 2–3 cümleyle cevap ver.","q":[["What's your name? Where do you live?",20,["my name is","I live in","I come from"],"My name is Deniz and I live in Izmir, in the west of Turkey. I've lived there all my life."],["Do you work or are you a student?",20,["I'm a student","I study","I work as"],"I'm a student. I'm in my last year at high school, and my favourite subject is biology."],["What do you usually do at the weekend?",30,["usually","often","at the weekend","I like"],"I usually meet my friends on Saturday and we go to a café or play football in the park. On Sundays I often stay at home and relax with my family."],["Tell us about something you did last week.",30,["last week","I went","it was"],"Last week I went to the cinema with my cousin. We watched a science fiction film. It was a bit long, but the special effects were amazing."],["What would you like to do in the future?",30,["I'd like to","I hope","I want to","because"],"I'd like to study medicine at university, because I want to help people. I also hope to travel to Canada one day."]]},{"id":"b1x-s2","p":2,"t":"Part 2 · Fotoğrafı anlat","ins":"Bu bölümde bir fotoğrafı yaklaşık 1 dakika anlatırsın: kimler var, ne yapıyorlar, nerede, neler görüyorsun, nasıl hissediyor olabilirler.","img":[["👨‍🍳👩‍🍳🧑‍🍳🍕🥗🔥","Bir mutfakta üç genç birlikte yemek yapıyor: biri pizza hamuru açıyor, biri salata hazırlıyor, arkada fırın yanıyor. Herkes gülümsüyor."]],"q":[["Now, here is your photograph. It shows people cooking together. Please tell us what you can see in the photograph.",60,["in this photo I can see","on the left","on the right","in the background","they are","it looks like","they seem"],"In this photo I can see three young people who are cooking together in a kitchen. On the left, a boy is making a pizza. He's wearing a white apron. In the middle, a girl is preparing a salad, and on the right another girl is watching the oven. In the background there's an oven, and it looks quite hot. They all seem very happy – I think they're friends and they're preparing dinner for a party. It looks like a modern kitchen, and there are lots of vegetables on the table."]]},{"id":"b1x-s3","p":3,"t":"Part 3 · Birlikte karar verme","ins":"Gerçek sınavda bu bölüm bir partnerle yapılır. Burada iki tarafı da sen düşün: önce seçenekleri tek tek değerlendir, sonra en iyisine karar ver.","opts":["🎨 sanat atölyesi","⚽ spor turnuvası","🎬 film gecesi","🌳 park temizliği","🎤 müzik yarışması"],"q":[["A school wants to organise an activity to help students make new friends. Here are some ideas they're thinking about. Talk about the different activities and say how they would help students make friends.",90,["what about","I think","because","it would be","on the other hand","that's a good idea","I'm not sure"],"Let's start with the art workshop. I think it would be good for quiet students, but people mostly work alone, so they might not talk very much. A sports tournament is fun, and students have to work in teams, so they would get to know each other. However, some people don't like sport. A film night is relaxing, but you can't talk during the film. Cleaning the park is a good idea because students work together and do something useful at the same time. A music competition could be exciting, but some students might feel nervous on stage."],["Now decide which activity would be best for making new friends.",30,["I think the best","because","I'd choose","in my opinion"],"In my opinion, the best activity would be the park clean-up, because everyone can join, students work together in small groups, and they have plenty of time to talk to each other."]]},{"id":"b1x-s4","p":4,"t":"Part 4 · Tartışma","ins":"Sınav görevlisi 3. bölümün konusuyla ilgili görüşünü soruyor. Her soruya fikrini ve nedenini söyle.","q":[["Is it easy or difficult to make new friends at a new school? Why?",40,["I think","because","for example","it depends"],"I think it can be quite difficult at first, because everyone already has their own group of friends. But if you join a club or a team, it becomes much easier, because you meet people who like the same things as you."],["Do you prefer doing activities in a big group or in a small group?",40,["I prefer","because","on the other hand","in a small group"],"I prefer small groups, because everyone can speak and you get to know people better. In a big group it's more exciting, but quiet people often don't say anything."],["Do you think young people spend too much time online instead of meeting friends?",40,["I agree","I don't think","however","for example","these days"],"I partly agree. These days many young people chat online for hours, and that isn't the same as meeting face to face. However, online chats can also help you stay in touch with friends who live far away."]]}]}},"lv":"B1","name":"B1 Preliminary"}],"prac":{"A2":{"R":[{"k":"R1","nm":"Okuma 1 · Kısa metinler","ti":"Reading Part 1","ins":"Her kısa metni oku ve metnin ne söylediğini en iyi anlatan seçeneği bul.","id":"a2r1","t":"Kısa metinler: dükkân ve okul duyuruları","ty":"mc","q":[{"q":"What does the sign say?","o":["Young children cannot swim here alone.","Adults can only swim with children.","The pool is closed to children."],"a":0,"tg":["must-have-to-should"],"e":"8 yaşından küçükler bir yetişkinle yüzmeli: tek başına yüzemez.","x":"SWIMMING POOL\nChildren under 8 must swim with an adult."},{"q":"What does Dad tell Jack?","o":["Mr Green will be late.","The lesson starts later than usual.","The lesson is cancelled today."],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"Ders 4 yerine 5'te: her zamankinden geç.","x":"Jack,\nYour guitar lesson is at 5 today, not 4. Mr Green phoned. Don't be late!\nDad"},{"q":"What does the shop say?","o":["T-shirts are cheaper this weekend only.","You get a free T-shirt if you buy two.","Shoes are half price this weekend."],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"\"buy two, get one free\": iki alana bir bedava.","x":"SALE\nAll shoes 30% off this weekend.\nT-shirts: buy two, get one free!"},{"q":"Why will the library close early on Friday?","o":["The teachers have a meeting.","The library is getting new books.","Students have a holiday."],"a":0,"tg":["detail"],"e":"\"because of a teachers' meeting\".","x":"To all students:\nThe school library will close at 3 p.m. on Friday because of a teachers' meeting."},{"q":"What does Zoe want Mia to do?","o":["take a camera to the party","fix Zoe's camera","buy a new camera"],"a":0,"tg":["purpose"],"e":"\"Can you bring your camera\" = partiye fotoğraf makinesini getirmesini istiyor.","x":"Hi Mia,\nCan you bring your camera to the party tomorrow? Mine is broken.\nZoe"}]},{"k":"R2","nm":"Okuma 2 · Kişi eşleştirme","ti":"Reading Part 2","ins":"Üç metni oku. Her soru için doğru kişiyi (A, B ya da C) seç. Bir kişi birden fazla kez seçilebilir.","id":"a2r2","t":"Kişi eşleştirme: yeni okullar","ty":"match","pl":"Yazılar","opts":[["A","Can","I moved to a new school in September. It's much bigger than my old one – there are 1,200 students! At first I got lost every day. Now I know my way around, and I've joined the photography club. The lessons are harder here, but my teachers are very helpful."],["B","Sophie","My new school is in a small village, so I take the bus for forty minutes every morning. There are only twelve students in my class, and we all know each other well. I miss my old friends, but we talk online every evening. The best thing here is the school garden – we grow our own vegetables."],["C","Leo","I started at my new school last month. I was nervous on the first day, but a boy called Sam showed me around and now he's my best friend. The school has a great sports hall, and I play basketball there after school. The only problem is lunch – the food isn't very good!"]],"q":[{"q":"Who travels a long way to school?","a":"B","tg":["detail"],"e":"Sophie her sabah 40 dakika otobüsle gidiyor."},{"q":"Who doesn't like the school food?","a":"C","tg":["detail"],"e":"Leo: \"the food isn't very good\"."},{"q":"Who finds the lessons more difficult now?","a":"A","tg":["comparatives-superlatives"],"e":"Can: \"The lessons are harder here\"."},{"q":"Who stays in contact with old friends?","a":"B","tg":["detail"],"e":"Sophie eski arkadaşlarıyla her akşam internetten konuşuyor."},{"q":"Who made a friend on the first day?","a":"C","tg":["detail"],"e":"Sam, Leo'ya okulu gezdirdi ve en iyi arkadaşı oldu."},{"q":"Who had problems finding places in the school?","a":"A","tg":["inference"],"e":"Can: \"At first I got lost every day\"."}]},{"k":"R3","nm":"Okuma 3 · Uzun metin","ti":"Reading Part 3","ins":"Metni oku ve soruları cevapla.","id":"a2r3","t":"Uzun metin: Genç bir yüzücü","ty":"mc","title":"A young swimmer","p":["Maya Lee is fourteen and she is one of the best young swimmers in the country. She started swimming when she was five, because her parents wanted her to be safe in the water. She wasn't very good at first, and she was afraid of putting her face in the water.","Now Maya trains six days a week. She gets up at half past five and swims for two hours before school. After school she goes to the gym. \"It's difficult,\" she says, \"but I love the feeling when I win a race.\"","Maya doesn't have much time to see her friends, but they often come to watch her races. Her best friend Hana makes big signs with Maya's name on them. Last year Maya won a silver medal at the national championships. Next year she hopes to swim for her country."],"q":[{"q":"Why did Maya start swimming?","o":["Her friends were in a swimming club.","Her parents wanted her to be safe.","She wanted to win medals."],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"\"because her parents wanted her to be safe in the water\"."},{"q":"What was Maya's problem when she started?","o":["She was afraid of the water.","She didn't like her teacher.","She was too young for lessons."],"a":0,"tg":["detail"],"e":"Yüzünü suya sokmaktan korkuyordu."},{"q":"What does Maya do before school?","o":["She goes to the gym.","She sleeps until half past seven.","She swims for two hours."],"a":2,"tg":["detail","present-simple"],"e":"5.30'da kalkıp okuldan önce iki saat yüzüyor. Spor salonu okuldan sonra."},{"q":"How does Hana help Maya?","o":["She trains with her.","She makes signs at her races.","She drives her to races."],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"Hana üzerinde Maya'nın adı olan büyük pankartlar yapıyor."},{"q":"What does Maya want to do next year?","o":["win a silver medal","spend more time with friends","swim for her country"],"a":2,"tg":["will-going-to"],"e":"\"Next year she hopes to swim for her country\"."}]},{"k":"R4","nm":"Okuma 4 · Çoktan seçmeli boşluk","ti":"Reading Part 4","ins":"Metni oku ve her boşluk için doğru kelimeyi seç.","id":"a2r4","t":"Çoktan seçmeli boşluk: Kahve","ty":"cloze","title":"Coffee","p":"People (1) ______ coffee for hundreds of years. Today it is one of the (2) ______ popular drinks in the world. Coffee comes from a plant that grows in hot countries, (3) ______ as Brazil and Ethiopia. Brazil produces more coffee (4) ______ any other country. Many people drink coffee in the morning because it helps them (5) ______ awake. But doctors say you (6) ______ drink too much of it.","o":[[["have drunk","drink","are drinking"],0,["present-perfect"]],[["more","most","much"],1,["comparatives-superlatives"]],[["like","such","so"],1,["vocab"]],[["then","that","than"],2,["comparatives-superlatives"]],[["stay","be staying","staying"],0,["vocab"]],[["mustn't","shouldn't","don't have to"],1,["must-have-to-should"]]],"e":["for hundreds of years: geçmişten bugüne süren durum → present perfect.","the most popular: en popüler.","such as: örneğin, gibi.","more ... than: -den daha çok.","help someone (to) do: birine bir şeyi yapmada yardım etmek; stay awake.","Tavsiye: shouldn't (doktorlar söylüyor; yasak değil)."]},{"k":"R5","nm":"Okuma 5 · Açık boşluk","ti":"Reading Part 5","ins":"Metni oku ve her boşluğa TEK kelime yaz.","id":"a2r5","t":"Açık boşluk: Kamp mesajı","ty":"open","one":true,"title":"Hi Dan","p":"Hi Dan,\nI'm writing this message (1) ______ the campsite! We arrived (2) ______ Tuesday. The weather is great and the lake is beautiful. Yesterday we went canoeing and I fell (3) ______ the water! It was very cold. Tomorrow we (4) ______ going to climb the mountain. I hope I won't be too tired. What are you doing this week? Write (5) ______ me soon!\nSee you,\n(6) ______ friend Alex","a":[["from","at"],["on","last"],["into","in"],["are"],["to"],["your"]],"tg":[["prepositions-in-on-at"],["prepositions-in-on-at"],["vocab"],["will-going-to"],["vocab"],["possessives"]],"e":["from/at the campsite: kamp yerinden / kamp yerinde.","Günlerle on: on Tuesday.","fall into the water: suya düşmek.","we are going to: plan.","Write to me: bana yaz.","your friend: arkadaşın."]}],"L":[{"k":"L1","nm":"Dinleme 1 · Kısa konuşmalar","ti":"Listening Part 1","ins":"Beş kısa konuşma dinleyeceksin. Her soru için doğru cevabı seç.","id":"a2l1","t":"Kısa konuşmalar: günlük durumlar","ty":"mc","q":[{"id":"a2l1a","sc":[["M","How much are these apples?"],["F","They're two pounds a kilo. But the green ones are cheaper – one pound fifty."],["M","I'll have a kilo of the green ones, please."]],"q":"How much will the man pay?","o":["£2.00","£1.50","£3.50"],"a":1,"tg":["spelling"],"e":"Yeşil elmalar kilosu 1,50."},{"id":"a2l1b","sc":[["F","What did you do on Saturday?"],["M","I wanted to go to the beach, but it was raining. So I stayed at home and cleaned my room."]],"q":"What did the boy do on Saturday?","o":["He went to the beach.","He cleaned his room.","He went shopping."],"a":1,"tg":["past-simple"],"e":"Yağmur yüzünden evde kalıp odasını temizledi."},{"id":"a2l1c","sc":[["M","Excuse me, where's the post office?"],["F","Go straight on, then turn left at the bank. It's next to the supermarket."]],"q":"Where is the post office?","o":["next to the bank","opposite the supermarket","next to the supermarket"],"a":2,"tg":["detail"],"e":"\"It's next to the supermarket\"."},{"id":"a2l1d","sc":[["F","Is your sister older than you?"],["M","No, she's younger. I'm twelve and she's nine. My brother is the oldest – he's sixteen."]],"q":"How old is the boy's sister?","o":["nine","twelve","sixteen"],"a":0,"tg":["comparatives-superlatives"],"e":"Kız kardeşi 9 yaşında."},{"id":"a2l1e","sc":[["M","What would you like to drink?"],["F","I usually have coffee, but it's so hot today. Can I have some orange juice with ice, please?"]],"q":"What will the woman drink?","o":["coffee","tea","orange juice"],"a":2,"tg":["detail"],"e":"Sıcak olduğu için buzlu portakal suyu istiyor."}]},{"k":"L2","nm":"Dinleme 2 · Not tamamlama","ti":"Listening Part 2","ins":"Bir kayıt dinleyeceksin. Her boşluğa bir kelime, sayı ya da tarih yaz.","id":"a2l2","t":"Not tamamlama: Bisiklet turu","ty":"open","title":"Notlar","sc":[["M","Good morning, and welcome to City Bike Tours. Our tour today starts at ten o'clock from the front of the railway station. The tour takes three hours, and we'll stop for lunch at a café by the river. The price is eighteen pounds, and that includes your bike and a helmet. Our guide today is called Jenny – that's J, E, double N, Y. Please wear comfortable shoes and bring a bottle of water. Enjoy your tour!"]],"p":"City Bike Tours\nMeeting place: in front of the (1) ______ station\nLength of tour: (2) ______ hours\nLunch: at a café by the (3) ______\nPrice: £(4) ______\nGuide's name: (5) ______","a":[["railway","train"],["3","three"],["river"],["18","eighteen"],["Jenny"]],"tg":[["detail"],["spelling"],["detail"],["spelling"],["spelling"]],"e":["\"from the front of the railway station\".","\"The tour takes three hours\".","\"a café by the river\".","\"eighteen pounds\".","J-E-N-N-Y."]},{"k":"L3","nm":"Dinleme 3 · Uzun konuşma","ti":"Listening Part 3","ins":"İki kişinin konuşmasını dinle ve soruları cevapla.","id":"a2l3","t":"Uzun konuşma: Yeni spor kulübü","ty":"mc","sc":[["M","Hi Lucy. I heard you joined the new sports club."],["F","Yes, I joined last week. It's great. It's near the school, so I can walk there."],["M","What sports can you do?"],["F","There's tennis, basketball and swimming. I wanted to try tennis, but the classes were full, so I'm doing basketball."],["M","Is it expensive?"],["F","It's twenty-five pounds a month for students. Adults pay forty."],["M","When do you go?"],["F","On Tuesdays and Thursdays after school. Why don't you come with me on Thursday?"],["M","I can't on Thursday, I have a piano lesson. But I could come on Tuesday."]],"q":[{"q":"How does Lucy get to the sports club?","o":["by bus","on foot","by bike"],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"Okula yakın, yürüyerek gidiyor."},{"q":"Which sport is Lucy doing?","o":["tennis","swimming","basketball"],"a":2,"tg":["detail"],"e":"Tenis dolu olduğu için basketbol yapıyor."},{"q":"How much does Lucy pay each month?","o":["£25","£40","£15"],"a":0,"tg":["spelling"],"e":"Öğrenciler ayda 25 sterlin."},{"q":"Why can't the boy go on Thursday?","o":["He has a piano lesson.","He has basketball practice.","He has to study."],"a":0,"tg":["detail"],"e":"Perşembe piyano dersi var."},{"q":"When might the boy go to the club?","o":["on Monday","on Tuesday","on Thursday"],"a":1,"tg":["may-might"],"e":"\"I could come on Tuesday\"."}]},{"k":"L4","nm":"Dinleme 4 · Kısa kayıtlar","ti":"Listening Part 4","ins":"Beş kısa kayıt dinleyeceksin. Her soru için doğru cevabı seç.","id":"a2l4","t":"Kısa kayıtlar: amaç ve konu","ty":"mc","q":[{"id":"a2l4a","sc":[["F","Hi Mark, it's Sally. I'm at the shops. Do you want me to buy anything for dinner tonight? Call me back."]],"q":"Why is Sally calling?","o":["to invite Mark to dinner","to offer to buy something","to ask for directions"],"a":1,"tg":["purpose"],"e":"Akşam yemeği için bir şey almasını isteyip istemediğini soruyor."},{"id":"a2l4b","sc":[["M","I went to the new Chinese restaurant last night. The food was delicious, but it was very expensive, and we waited forty minutes for a table."]],"q":"What did the man like about the restaurant?","o":["the prices","the food","the service"],"a":1,"tg":["attitude"],"e":"Yemek lezzetliydi; fiyat ve bekleme olumsuz."},{"id":"a2l4c","sc":[["F","Attention please. The museum will close in fifteen minutes. Please make your way to the main exit. The gift shop is open until six."]],"q":"Where is the woman speaking?","o":["in a museum","in a shop","at a station"],"a":0,"tg":["inference"],"e":"\"The museum will close in fifteen minutes\"."},{"id":"a2l4d","sc":[["M","I usually get up at seven, but today I got up at six because I had to finish my homework before school."]],"q":"Why did the boy get up early today?","o":["He had a test.","He had homework to do.","He wanted to go running."],"a":1,"tg":["detail","past-simple"],"e":"Ödevini bitirmesi gerekiyordu."},{"id":"a2l4e","sc":[["F","You'll love this film. It's about a family who travel around the world in a small boat. It's funny, but it's also quite sad at the end."]],"q":"What is the film about?","o":["a family's journey","a sad love story","a funny school"],"a":0,"tg":["gist"],"e":"Küçük bir teknede dünyayı dolaşan bir aile."}]},{"k":"L5","nm":"Dinleme 5 · Eşleştirme","ti":"Listening Part 5","ins":"Bir konuşma dinleyeceksin. Her kişiyi doğru seçenekle (A–H) eşleştir. Üç seçenek fazladır.","id":"a2l5","t":"Eşleştirme: Doğum günü hediyeleri","ty":"match","sc":[["F","Dad, it's Grandma's birthday on Sunday. What is everyone giving her?"],["M","Well, your uncle Peter is giving her some flowers from his garden."],["F","And Aunt Rose? She usually gives her a book."],["M","Not this year. She's bought her a scarf, a red one."],["F","What about Tom?"],["M","Tom's made a cake. He's been practising for weeks!"],["F","And Mum?"],["M","Mum's giving her some theatre tickets. They're going together next month."],["F","I want to give her something special too. Maybe I'll paint a picture of her garden."],["M","She'll love that."]],"opts":[["A","a book"],["B","a cake"],["C","flowers"],["D","a painting"],["E","a scarf"],["F","theatre tickets"],["G","chocolates"],["H","a photo album"]],"q":[{"q":"Uncle Peter","a":"C","tg":["detail"],"e":"Bahçesinden çiçek."},{"q":"Aunt Rose","a":"E","tg":["detail"],"e":"Bu yıl kitap değil, kırmızı bir atkı."},{"q":"Tom","a":"B","tg":["detail","present-perfect"],"e":"Tom pasta yaptı."},{"q":"Mum","a":"F","tg":["detail"],"e":"Tiyatro biletleri."},{"q":"The girl","a":"D","tg":["detail","will-going-to"],"e":"Büyükannesinin bahçesinin resmini yapacak."}]}],"W":[{"id":"a2w1","part":6,"t":"E-posta: Doğum günü partisi","in":"You are having a birthday party next Saturday. Write an email to your English friend Sam. In your email:\n• invite Sam to the party\n• say where the party is\n• say what Sam should bring.\nWrite 25 words or more.","mail":"To: Sam\nSubject: My party","pts":[["Partiye davet et",["party","come","would you like","invite"]],["Partinin yerini söyle",["at my house","at the","in the","park","café","restaurant","home"]],["Ne getirmesi gerektiğini söyle",["bring","please bring","can you bring"]]],"min":25,"max":60,"model":"Hi Sam,\nI'm having a birthday party next Saturday and I'd love you to come! It's at my house at 4 o'clock. Please bring your favourite music, and some snacks if you can.\nSee you,\nAyşe"},{"id":"a2w2","part":6,"t":"E-posta: Kitap ödünç istemek","in":"Your English friend Jo has a book you want to read. Write an email to Jo. In your email:\n• ask to borrow the book\n• say why you want to read it\n• say when you will give it back.\nWrite 25 words or more.","mail":"To: Jo\nSubject: Your book","pts":[["Kitabı ödünç iste",["borrow","can i","could i","lend"]],["Neden okumak istediğini söyle",["because","i want","i love","interested"]],["Ne zaman geri vereceğini söyle",["give it back","return","next week","on monday","on friday","in two weeks","bring it back"]]],"min":25,"max":60,"model":"Hi Jo,\nCould I borrow your book about space, please? I want to read it because we're studying the planets at school and it looks really interesting. I'll give it back next Friday.\nThanks,\nMert"},{"id":"a2w3","part":6,"t":"E-posta: Yeni telefon","in":"You have just bought a new phone. Write an email to your English friend Chris. In your email:\n• say where you bought it\n• say what colour it is\n• say what you like about it.\nWrite 25 words or more.","mail":"To: Chris\nSubject: My new phone","pts":[["Nereden aldığını söyle",["bought it","from","at the","shop","online","centre"]],["Rengini söyle",["black","white","blue","red","green","silver","gold","pink","purple","grey"]],["Neyini sevdiğini söyle",["like","love","camera","screen","battery","fast","because"]]],"min":25,"max":60,"model":"Hi Chris,\nGuess what? I've got a new phone! I bought it at the shopping centre last weekend. It's dark blue. I really like it because the camera is excellent and the battery lasts all day.\nBye,\nSelin"},{"id":"a2w4","part":7,"kind":"story","t":"Resimli hikâye: Kayıp köpek","in":"Look at the three pictures. Write the story shown in the pictures.\nWrite 35 words or more.","mail":"Picture 1: 👧🐕🌳  (Bir kız parkta köpeğini gezdiriyor.)\nPicture 2: 🐕💨🐿️  (Köpek bir sincabın peşinden koşup kayboluyor.)\nPicture 3: 👧👮🐕  (Bir polis memuru köpeği kıza geri getiriyor.)","pts":[["Kızı ve köpeği anlat",["dog","walk","walking","park"]],["Köpeğin kaçtığını anlat",["ran","run","squirrel","lost","away"]],["Sonucu anlat",["police","found","brought","back","happy"]],["Geçmiş zaman kullan",["was","went","ran","found","brought","looked"]]],"min":35,"max":80,"model":"One afternoon, Zeynep was walking her dog, Max, in the park. Suddenly Max saw a squirrel and ran after it. Zeynep looked everywhere, but she couldn't find him. She was very worried. An hour later, a police officer brought Max back to her. Zeynep was really happy."},{"id":"a2w5","part":7,"kind":"story","t":"Resimli hikâye: Plajda bir gün","in":"Look at the three pictures. Write the story shown in the pictures.\nWrite 35 words or more.","mail":"Picture 1: 👨‍👩‍👦🚗🏖️  (Bir aile arabayla plaja gidiyor.)\nPicture 2: 🌧️☔😮  (Plajda birden yağmur başlıyor.)\nPicture 3: 🍕🏠😄  (Aile evde pizza yiyip oyun oynuyor.)","pts":[["Plaja gidişi anlat",["beach","car","drove","went"]],["Yağmuru anlat",["rain","rained","raining","suddenly"]],["Sonucu anlat",["home","pizza","game","played","happy","fun"]],["Geçmiş zaman kullan",["was","went","drove","started","ate","played"]]],"min":35,"max":80,"model":"Last summer, Can and his parents drove to the beach. They wanted to swim and play volleyball. But after ten minutes, it suddenly started to rain! They ran back to the car and went home. In the evening they ate pizza and played board games. It was a fun day after all."}],"S":[{"id":"a2s1","p":1,"t":"Part 1 · Tanışma: okul ve ev","ins":"Kısa sorulara tam cümlelerle cevap ver.","q":[["What's your favourite subject at school? Why?",25,["my favourite","because","I like"],"My favourite subject is science, because we do lots of experiments and I like learning how things work."],["How do you get to school?",20,["I go","by bus","on foot","I walk","it takes"],"I usually go to school by bus. It takes about twenty minutes."],["What do you usually have for breakfast?",20,["I usually have","I eat","I drink"],"I usually have bread, cheese, olives and a glass of tea."],["Tell me about your bedroom.",30,["there is","there are","my bedroom","I have"],"My bedroom is quite small, but I love it. There is a bed, a desk and a big window. I have lots of posters of my favourite football players on the wall."]]},{"id":"a2s2","p":1,"t":"Part 1 · Tanışma: hafta sonu ve tatil","ins":"Kısa sorulara tam cümlelerle cevap ver.","q":[["What did you do last weekend?",25,["last weekend","I went","I visited","I watched"],"Last weekend I visited my grandparents in their village. We had a big lunch and I played with my cousins."],["Where did you go on your last holiday?",25,["I went to","we stayed","it was"],"Last summer I went to Antalya with my family. We stayed in a hotel near the sea. It was really hot."],["What are you going to do next summer?",25,["I'm going to","I want to","I hope"],"Next summer I'm going to work in my uncle's shop, and I hope to go camping with my friends."],["Tell me about your best friend.",30,["my best friend","he is","she is","we","because"],"My best friend is called Arda. We've known each other since primary school. He's funny and kind, and we play computer games together every weekend."]]},{"id":"a2s3","p":2,"t":"Part 2 · Resimler: tatil türleri","ins":"Resimlerdeki tatil türleri hakkında kendi görüşünü söyle.","opts":["⛺ camping","🏙️ city holiday","🏖️ beach holiday","⛷️ skiing","🚢 boat trip"],"q":[["Here are some pictures of different holidays. Do you like these different holidays? Say why or why not.",60,["I like","I don't like","because","I think"],"I like camping because you can sleep outside and see the stars. City holidays are interesting, but they can be expensive. I love beach holidays – swimming in the sea is my favourite thing. Skiing looks exciting, but I've never tried it. A boat trip would be fun, but I sometimes feel sick on boats."],["Which of these holidays would you like best? Why?",30,["I'd like","best","because"],"I'd like a beach holiday best, because I love swimming and relaxing in the sun."],["Do you prefer holidays with your family or with friends?",30,["I prefer","because"],"I prefer holidays with my family, because my parents plan everything and we have a lot of fun together."]]},{"id":"a2s4","p":2,"t":"Part 2 · Resimler: yemek ve içecek","ins":"Resimlerdeki yiyecekler hakkında kendi görüşünü söyle.","opts":["🍕 pizza","🥗 salad","🍣 sushi","🍲 soup","🍰 cake"],"q":[["Here are some pictures of different food. Do you like these different kinds of food? Say why or why not.",60,["I like","I don't like","because","delicious","healthy"],"I love pizza – it's my favourite food! Salad is healthy, but I don't eat it very often. I've never tried sushi, but my sister likes it. Soup is nice in winter when it's cold. And cake is delicious, but I only eat it on special days."],["Which of these do you like best? Why?",30,["I like ... best","because","my favourite"],"I like pizza best, because there are so many different kinds and I can eat it with my friends."],["Do you like cooking? Why or why not?",30,["I like","I don't","because","sometimes"],"Yes, I like cooking a little. I sometimes help my mother in the kitchen. I can make pasta and eggs."]]},{"id":"a2s5","p":2,"t":"Part 2 · Resimler: şehirde yaşam","ins":"Resimlerdeki yerler hakkında kendi görüşünü söyle.","opts":["🏬 shopping centre","🏞️ park","🏛️ museum","🎬 cinema","🏟️ stadium"],"q":[["Here are some pictures of places in a town. Do you like going to these places? Say why or why not.",60,["I like","I don't like","because","sometimes"],"I like going to the shopping centre with my friends, but it's often very crowded. Parks are great because they're quiet and green. Museums can be interesting, but some are boring. I love the cinema – I go every month. I've been to the stadium twice to watch football, and it was very exciting."],["Which place do you go to most often? Why?",30,["most often","because","usually"],"I go to the park most often, because it's near my house and I can play basketball there."],["Is it better to live in a city or in the countryside? Why?",30,["I think","better","because"],"I think it's better to live in a city, because there are more things to do. But the countryside is cleaner and quieter."]]}]},"B1":{"R":[{"k":"R1","nm":"Okuma 1 · Kısa metinler","ti":"Reading Part 1","ins":"Her kısa metni oku ve metnin ne söylediğini en iyi anlatan seçeneği bul.","ty":"mc","q":[{"x":"LIBRARY\nBooks must be returned within three weeks. You can renew them online if nobody else has asked for them.","q":"What does the notice say?","o":["You can keep a book for longer if no one is waiting for it.","You must return books in person after three weeks.","You can only borrow three books at a time."],"a":0,"tg":["detail","must-have-to-should"],"e":"\"renew them online if nobody else has asked for them\" = kimse beklemiyorsa süreyi uzatabilirsin."},{"x":"Dad,\nThe plumber phoned. He can't come today, but he could come tomorrow at 8 a.m. if someone is at home. Can you call him back?\nKate","q":"What does Kate want her father to do?","o":["stay at home today","contact the plumber","repair the problem himself"],"a":1,"tg":["purpose"],"e":"\"Can you call him back?\" = tesisatçıyı geri araması isteniyor."},{"x":"FOR SALE\nChildren's bike, 2 years old, hardly used. Suitable for ages 6–9. Price can be discussed.","q":"What does the advert say?","o":["The bike is brand new.","The seller might accept a lower price.","The bike is for adults."],"a":1,"tg":["inference","vocab"],"e":"\"Price can be discussed\" = fiyat konuşulabilir, yani daha düşük bir fiyat kabul edilebilir."},{"x":"Gym members: From 1st June, you will need your membership card to enter the building. Cards can be collected from reception.","q":"What must gym members do?","o":["pay for a new card","show a card to get in","arrive before 1st June"],"a":1,"tg":["detail","passive-voice"],"e":"1 Haziran'dan itibaren binaya girmek için üyelik kartı gerekiyor."},{"x":"Hey Paul, I've finished with your camera, thanks! I'd have returned it yesterday but I was ill. I'll drop it round after work. Jack","q":"What is Jack going to do?","o":["buy a new camera","return the camera today","borrow the camera again"],"a":1,"tg":["inference","third-conditional"],"e":"Dün getirecekti ama hastaydı; bugün iş çıkışı getirecek."}],"id":"b1r1","t":"Kısa metinler: duyurular ve mesajlar"},{"k":"R2","nm":"Okuma 2 · Eşleştirme","ti":"Reading Part 2","ins":"Aşağıdaki beş kişi bir kitap arıyor. Her kişi için en uygun kitabı (A–H) seç.","ty":"match","pl":"Metinler (A–H)","opts":[["A","The Last Signal","A thriller about a girl who finds a mysterious radio message. Full of surprises from start to finish, but suitable for all ages."],["B","Midnight House","A horror story that will keep you awake at night. Not for anyone who scares easily!"],["C","Small Space, Big Harvest","How to grow tomatoes, beans and herbs in pots on a balcony or windowsill."],["D","The Perfect Garden","Ideas for designing large gardens, with plans for lawns, trees and ponds."],["E","Mountain Rescue","The true story of a team who saved climbers in a storm. Includes many photographs from the rescue."],["F","Brave Hearts","A novel about two friends who sail around the world. Beautiful writing, but quite long."],["G","My Crazy Dog","A comic story told in very short chapters, perfect for young readers who don't enjoy long books."],["H","Italy on a Budget","Where to sleep, eat and travel in Italy without spending too much. Maps and prices included."]],"q":[{"q":"Leyla: Leyla is going on a long train journey. She wants an exciting story that will keep her reading, but nothing too frightening.","a":"A","tg":["detail"],"e":"Heyecanlı ama korkutucu değil: A (B korku)."},{"q":"Oscar: Oscar wants to learn how to grow vegetables in a small space. He has a balcony but no garden.","a":"C","tg":["detail"],"e":"Balkon, sebze: C (D büyük bahçe)."},{"q":"Nina: Nina loves true stories about people who did something brave. She prefers books with photographs.","a":"E","tg":["detail"],"e":"Gerçek cesaret hikâyesi, fotoğraflı: E (F roman)."},{"q":"Ryan: Ryan is 14 and finds reading difficult. He wants something funny with short chapters.","a":"G","tg":["detail"],"e":"Komik, kısa bölümler: G."},{"q":"Mei: Mei is planning a trip to Italy. She wants practical information about cheap places to stay and eat.","a":"H","tg":["detail"],"e":"İtalya, ucuz kalacak yer ve yemek: H."}],"id":"b1r2","t":"Eşleştirme: kitap seçimi"},{"k":"R3","nm":"Okuma 3 · Uzun metin","ti":"Reading Part 3","ins":"Metni oku ve soruları cevapla.","ty":"mc","title":"Learning to play the drums","p":["I'd always wanted to play the drums, but when I was younger my parents said they were too noisy for our flat. So when I moved into my own house at the age of thirty-two, the first thing I bought was a drum kit.","At first I tried to teach myself using videos on the internet. I learned a few simple rhythms, but I soon realised I was making the same mistakes again and again. A friend suggested that I take lessons, and she gave me the number of a teacher called Marcus.","Marcus was patient but strict. He made me practise slowly with a metronome, which I found boring at first. \"If you can't play it slowly, you can't play it fast,\" he kept saying. After a couple of months, I understood what he meant: my playing had become much more confident.","Six months later, Marcus invited me to join a group of his students who played together every Friday. I was nervous, but it was the best thing I have ever done. Playing with other musicians is completely different from playing alone. Now I can't imagine my life without music."],"q":[{"q":"Why didn't the writer play the drums when he was young?","o":["He wasn't interested in music.","His family thought they were too loud.","Drum lessons were too expensive.","He didn't have time."],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"Ailesi davulun daire için çok gürültülü olduğunu söyledi."},{"q":"What problem did the writer have when he learned from videos?","o":["The videos were too difficult.","He kept repeating errors.","He couldn't find good videos.","He got bored quickly."],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"\"making the same mistakes again and again\""},{"q":"What did Marcus believe?","o":["Students should play fast from the start.","Practising slowly helps you play well.","Using a metronome is boring.","Lessons should be short."],"a":1,"tg":["inference","first-conditional"],"e":"\"If you can't play it slowly, you can't play it fast\" – yavaş çalışmak iyi çalmayı sağlar."},{"q":"How did the writer feel about joining the group?","o":["bored","nervous but glad he did it","disappointed","confident from the beginning"],"a":1,"tg":["attitude","present-perfect"],"e":"\"I was nervous, but it was the best thing I have ever done\""},{"q":"What would be the best title for the text?","o":["Why drums are too noisy","How to find a good teacher","A dream that came true later in life","The problems of living alone"],"a":2,"tg":["gist"],"e":"Çocukken çalamadığı davulu yetişkinken öğrenip müziği hayatının parçası yaptı."}],"id":"b1r3","t":"Uzun metin: davul öğrenmek"},{"k":"R4","nm":"Okuma 4 · Cümle yerleştirme","ti":"Reading Part 4","ins":"Metinden beş cümle çıkarıldı. Her boşluk için uygun cümleyi (A–H) seç. Üç cümle fazladır.","ty":"gap","title":"A school with no homework","p":"Last year, Westfield School stopped giving homework to students under fourteen. The head teacher, Mr Collins, says the decision was not easy. (1) ______ But after reading many studies, he decided to try it.\nInstead of homework, students now spend the last hour of the school day on projects. (2) ______ Teachers are there to help if anyone gets stuck.\nParents had mixed feelings at the start. (3) ______ Others were happy that family evenings were less stressful.\nAfter one year, the results are interesting. Exam results have stayed the same. (4) ______ Students say they feel less tired and more interested in learning.\nThe school will continue the experiment for another two years. (5) ______ If the results are still positive, other schools in the area may follow.","opts":[["A","Some were worried that their children would fall behind."],["B","Many teachers were afraid that students would learn less."],["C","They can choose what to work on, and they often work in small groups."],["D","However, the number of students who say they enjoy school has gone up."],["E","During this time, researchers will collect more information."],["F","Homework is still compulsory for older students at weekends."],["G","The students wrote a letter to the newspaper about it."],["H","Exam results fell sharply in the first term."]],"a":["B","C","A","D","E"],"tg":[["coherence"],["coherence"],["reference"],["linkers-contrast-purpose"],["reference"]],"e":["Karar kolay değildi çünkü öğretmenler endişeliydi; \"But after reading many studies\" ile devam ediyor: B.","Projelerle ilgili ayrıntı; \"Teachers are there to help\": C.","\"Some ... Others ...\" yapısı: A.","Sınav sonuçları aynı kaldı; \"However\" ile olumlu fark: D (H çelişir).","\"During this time\" = iki yıllık süre: E."],"id":"b1r4","t":"Cümle yerleştirme: ödevsiz okul"},{"k":"R5","nm":"Okuma 5 · Çoktan seçmeli boşluk","ti":"Reading Part 5","ins":"Metni oku ve her boşluk için doğru kelimeyi seç.","ty":"cloze","title":"The village festival","p":"Every summer, our village (1) ______ a festival to raise money for the local school. It started in 1985 and it has become more popular (2) ______ year. This year more than two thousand people came, (3) ______ the weather was cold and cloudy. There were lots of (4) ______ for children, including face painting and a treasure hunt. My favourite part was the music competition, which was (5) ______ by a local band. We raised over five thousand pounds, which will be (6) ______ on new computers for the school.","o":[[["holds","takes","makes","gives"],0,["vocab"]],[["all","every","each other","whole"],1,["vocab"]],[["despite","however","even though","because"],2,["linkers-contrast-purpose"]],[["activities","activity","actions","acts"],0,["countable-uncountable"]],[["won","beaten","earned","gained"],0,["passive-voice"]],[["spent","paid","bought","used"],0,["passive-advanced"]]],"e":["hold a festival: festival düzenlemek.","every year: her yıl.","even though + cümle: -mesine rağmen (despite + isim alır).","lots of + çoğul sayılabilir isim: activities.","win a competition: yarışmayı kazanmak (pasif: was won).","spend money on something: bir şeye para harcamak (pasif: will be spent on)."],"id":"b1r5","t":"Çoktan seçmeli boşluk: köy festivali"},{"k":"R6","nm":"Okuma 6 · Açık boşluk","ti":"Reading Part 6","ins":"Metni oku ve her boşluğa TEK kelime yaz.","ty":"open","title":"Dear Mr Lee","p":"Dear Mr Lee,\nThank you for your email. I am very interested (1) ______ the summer job at your café. I have worked in a restaurant before, so I know how busy it can be. I am available from 1st July (2) ______ the end of August. I can work at weekends, but I am not able to work (3) ______ Monday mornings because I have a language class. I would be grateful (4) ______ you could tell me what time the job starts each day. I am sending my CV with this email. I look forward to (5) ______ from you.\nYours sincerely,\nAyşe Kaya\nP.S. Could you also tell me (6) ______ I need to bring a uniform?","a":[["in"],["until","to","till"],["on"],["if"],["hearing"],["if","whether"]],"tg":[["prepositions-in-on-at"],["prepositions-in-on-at"],["prepositions-in-on-at"],["second-conditional"],["gerund-infinitive"],["reported-speech"]],"e":["interested in: -e ilgili.","from ... until / to: -den ... -e kadar.","Gün adıyla on: on Monday mornings.","I would be grateful if you could ...: nazik rica.","look forward to + -ing: hearing.","Dolaylı evet / hayır sorusu: if / whether."],"id":"b1r6","t":"Açık boşluk: Mr Lee'ye mektup"}],"L":[{"k":"L1","nm":"Dinleme 1 · Kısa kayıtlar","ti":"Listening Part 1","ins":"Yedi kısa kayıt dinleyeceksin. Her soru için doğru cevabı seç.","ty":"mc","q":[{"id":"l1a","sc":[["F","Hello, I'd like to book a table for Friday evening."],["M","Certainly. For how many people?"],["F","There'll be six of us. Oh, actually, my brother can't come, so five."]],"q":"How many people will be at the table?","o":["four","five","six"],"a":1,"tg":["detail","spelling"],"e":"Önce altı dedi, sonra kardeşi gelemeyeceği için beş."},{"id":"l1b","sc":[["M","What are you doing this weekend?"],["F","I was going to go camping, but the forecast says it's going to rain. So I'll probably visit my cousins in London instead."]],"q":"What will the woman probably do this weekend?","o":["go camping","stay at home","visit her cousins"],"a":2,"tg":["detail","will-going-to"],"e":"Kampa gidecekti ama yağmur yüzünden kuzenlerini ziyaret edecek."},{"id":"l1c","sc":[["F","Excuse me, where can I find the shampoo?"],["M","It's not with the soap any more. We've moved it next to the toothpaste, at the end of aisle four."]],"q":"Where is the shampoo now?","o":["next to the soap","next to the toothpaste","at the entrance"],"a":1,"tg":["detail","present-perfect"],"e":"Artık sabunların yanında değil, diş macunlarının yanında."},{"id":"l1d","sc":[["M","Hi Jo, it's Dan. The football match on Saturday starts at three, but the coach wants us there forty-five minutes early to warm up. See you then!"]],"q":"What time should Jo arrive?","o":["2.15","2.45","3.00"],"a":0,"tg":["detail","must-have-to-should"],"e":"Maç 3'te, 45 dakika önce orada olmalılar: 2.15."},{"id":"l1e","sc":[["F","How did you get here so quickly?"],["M","Normally I take the bus, but today my neighbour gave me a lift in his car."],["F","Lucky you!"]],"q":"How did the man travel today?","o":["by bus","by car","on foot"],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"Bugün komşusu arabasıyla bıraktı."},{"id":"l1f","sc":[["M","Did you like the jacket?"],["F","The colour was perfect, but it was too small, and they didn't have a bigger size. So I bought a jumper instead."]],"q":"Why didn't the woman buy the jacket?","o":["She didn't like the colour.","It was the wrong size.","It was too expensive."],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"Rengi güzeldi ama küçüktü, büyük bedeni yoktu."},{"id":"l1g","sc":[["F","This is a message for passengers on the twelve fifteen train to Manchester. This train will now leave from platform seven, not platform three. We apologise for any inconvenience."]],"q":"Which platform will the train leave from?","o":["3","7","12"],"a":1,"tg":["detail","spelling"],"e":"\"from platform seven, not platform three\""}],"id":"b1l1","t":"Kısa kayıtlar (7 soru)"},{"k":"L2","nm":"Dinleme 2 · Kısa konuşmalar","ti":"Listening Part 2","ins":"Altı kısa konuşma dinleyeceksin. Her soru için doğru cevabı seç.","ty":"mc","q":[{"id":"l2a","sc":[["M","How was the concert?"],["F","The band were great, but we were so far from the stage that we couldn't see anything."],["M","What a shame."]],"q":"What was the woman's problem at the concert?","o":["The music was bad.","Her seat was too far away.","It was too crowded."],"a":1,"tg":["attitude"],"e":"Sahneden çok uzaktaydılar, hiçbir şey göremediler."},{"id":"l2b","sc":[["F","I hear you're learning Japanese."],["M","Yes. Speaking isn't too bad, but I find the writing system really hard to remember."]],"q":"What does the man find difficult?","o":["speaking","writing","listening"],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"Yazı sistemini hatırlamak zor."},{"id":"l2c","sc":[["M","Did you enjoy the hotel?"],["F","The room was lovely and the staff were friendly. I just wish it had been closer to the beach. We had to take a bus every day."]],"q":"What would the woman change about the hotel?","o":["the room","the staff","the location"],"a":2,"tg":["attitude","wish-if-only"],"e":"\"I wish it had been closer to the beach\" – konum."},{"id":"l2d","sc":[["F","Are you going to the party tonight?"],["M","I'd like to, but I have an exam tomorrow morning. If I go out, I won't be able to concentrate."]],"q":"Why won't the man go to the party?","o":["He isn't invited.","He needs to study.","He feels ill."],"a":1,"tg":["inference","first-conditional"],"e":"Yarın sınavı var; dışarı çıkarsa odaklanamaz."},{"id":"l2e","sc":[["M","What do you think of the new sports centre?"],["F","It's modern and there's lots of equipment, but it costs twice as much as the old one. I don't think I'll renew my membership."]],"q":"What does the woman think about the sports centre?","o":["It is too expensive.","It is too old.","It doesn't have enough equipment."],"a":0,"tg":["attitude","comparatives-superlatives"],"e":"\"costs twice as much as the old one\" – çok pahalı."},{"id":"l2f","sc":[["F","You didn't answer my calls yesterday."],["M","Sorry. I left my phone at work and didn't realise until I got home. It must have been in my desk drawer."]],"q":"Why didn't the man answer his phone?","o":["It was broken.","He didn't have it with him.","He was too busy."],"a":1,"tg":["detail","modals-deduction"],"e":"Telefonunu işte unutmuştu."}],"id":"b1l2","t":"Kısa konuşmalar: görüşler"},{"k":"L3","nm":"Dinleme 3 · Not tamamlama","ti":"Listening Part 3","ins":"Bir yaz kampı duyurusunu dinle. Her boşluğa bir kelime, sayı ya da tarih yaz.","ty":"open","id":"b1l3","sc":[["M","Hello, and thanks for your interest in Green Valley Summer Camp. This year the camp runs from the fourteenth of July for two weeks. It is open to young people aged eleven to sixteen. Every morning there are outdoor activities, such as canoeing and climbing. In the afternoon, campers can choose between art, music and drama. The price is three hundred and fifty pounds, which includes all meals and equipment. Campers sleep in wooden cabins, with six people in each one. Please remember to bring a sleeping bag and a torch. You do not need to bring any sports equipment. To book a place, visit our website before the end of May. We look forward to seeing you!"]],"title":"Notlar","p":"Green Valley Summer Camp\nStart date: (1) ______ July\nAge: 11 to (2) ______\nAfternoon choices: art, music and (3) ______\nPrice: £(4) ______\nCampers sleep in wooden (5) ______\nRemember to bring a sleeping bag and a (6) ______","a":[["14","14th","fourteenth","fourteen"],["16","sixteen"],["drama"],["350","three hundred and fifty"],["cabins","cabin"],["torch"]],"tg":[["spelling"],["spelling"],["detail"],["spelling"],["detail"],["detail"]],"e":["\"from the fourteenth of July\"","\"aged eleven to sixteen\"","\"art, music and drama\"","\"three hundred and fifty pounds\"","\"sleep in wooden cabins\"","\"bring a sleeping bag and a torch\""],"t":"Not tamamlama: yaz kampı"},{"k":"L4","nm":"Dinleme 4 · Röportaj","ti":"Listening Part 4","ins":"Bir gönüllüyle yapılan röportajı dinle ve soruları cevapla.","ty":"mc","id":"b1l4","sc":[["F","My guest today is Tom Hughes, who spent a year volunteering on a farm in New Zealand. Tom, why did you decide to go?"],["M","I'd just finished university and I didn't know what job I wanted. A friend had done something similar and said it had changed her life, so I thought, why not?"],["F","What was a typical day like?"],["M","We started at six, which was hard at first because I'm not a morning person! We fed the animals, fixed fences and helped in the fields. The work was physical, but I got used to it after a few weeks."],["F","Was there anything you didn't enjoy?"],["M","Honestly, the work was fine. What I found difficult was being so far from my family. The farm was in the middle of nowhere, and the internet was terrible, so I could only call home once a week."],["F","What did you learn from the experience?"],["M","I learned that I really enjoy working outdoors. Before I went, I thought I wanted an office job, but now I'm training to be a park ranger."],["F","Would you recommend it to others?"],["M","Definitely, but I'd tell people to be prepared. It isn't a holiday. If you want to relax on the beach, it's not for you."]],"q":[{"q":"Why did Tom go to New Zealand?","o":["A friend told him it was a good experience.","He wanted to study farming.","His university organised it."],"a":0,"tg":["detail","reported-speech"],"e":"Arkadaşı benzer bir şey yapmış ve hayatını değiştirdiğini söylemişti."},{"q":"What was difficult for Tom at the beginning?","o":["the heavy work","getting up early","looking after animals"],"a":1,"tg":["detail","used-to"],"e":"Sabah altıda başlamak ilk başta zordu; \"not a morning person\"."},{"q":"What did Tom find hardest during the year?","o":["the physical work","missing his family","the bad weather"],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"Ailesinden bu kadar uzak olmak."},{"q":"Why could Tom only call home once a week?","o":["Phone calls were expensive.","The internet connection was poor.","He was too busy."],"a":1,"tg":["detail"],"e":"\"the internet was terrible\""},{"q":"How has the experience changed Tom's plans?","o":["He wants to work outside now.","He wants to live in New Zealand.","He has decided to get an office job."],"a":0,"tg":["inference"],"e":"Ofis işi isterken artık park bekçisi olmak için eğitim alıyor."},{"q":"What advice does Tom give?","o":["Take a holiday first.","Understand that it is hard work.","Go with a friend."],"a":1,"tg":["attitude"],"e":"\"be prepared. It isn't a holiday.\""}],"t":"Röportaj: gönüllü çalışma"},{"k":"L3","id":"b1l5","t":"Not tamamlama: Yemek kursu","nm":"Dinleme 3 · Not tamamlama","ti":"Listening Part 3","ty":"open","title":"Notlar","ins":"Bir yemek kursu tanıtımını dinle. Her boşluğa bir kelime, sayı ya da tarih yaz.","sc":[["M","Hello, and thanks for calling the Green Kitchen Cookery School. Here is some information about our summer course for young people. The course is for students aged fourteen to eighteen, and it runs for two weeks, starting on the third of July. Classes take place every weekday morning from ten until one. In the first week, students learn how to make different kinds of bread, and in the second week we focus on Italian dishes, especially pasta. The course costs one hundred and twenty pounds, and that includes all the food. Students only need to bring an apron. At the end of the course, there is a special lunch, and every student can invite two members of their family. To book a place, please visit our website or send us an email. We look forward to cooking with you!"]],"p":"Green Kitchen summer course\nAge: 14 to 18\nStarts on: (1) ______ July\nClasses every weekday: 10 a.m. to (2) ______ p.m.\nWeek 1: different kinds of (3) ______\nWeek 2: Italian food, especially (4) ______\nPrice: £(5) ______, including all the food\nStudents must bring: an (6) ______","a":[["3","3rd","third"],["1","one","1.00"],["bread"],["pasta"],["120","one hundred and twenty"],["apron"]],"tg":[["spelling"],["spelling"],["detail"],["detail"],["spelling"],["detail"]],"e":["\"starting on the third of July\"","\"from ten until one\"","\"how to make different kinds of bread\"","\"Italian dishes, especially pasta\"","\"one hundred and twenty pounds\"","\"Students only need to bring an apron\""]}],"W":[{"id":"b1w1","part":1,"t":"E-posta: Yeni spor kulübü","in":"Read this email from your English friend Alex and the notes you have made. Write your email to Alex using all the notes.","mail":"From: Alex\nSubject: Sports club\n\nHi!\nI've just joined a new sports club and I want you to come with me next Saturday. [Great!]\nWe can play tennis or go swimming – which would you prefer? [Tell Alex]\nThe club opens at 9 a.m. What time can you meet? [Suggest a time]\nAfter that, shall we have lunch together? [No, because ...]\nAlex","pts":[["Teşekkür et / sevindiğini söyle",["great","thanks","thank you","love to","sounds","fantastic","brilliant"]],["Tenis mi yüzme mi, seçimini söyle",["tennis","swim"]],["Bir buluşma saati öner",["o'clock","a.m","am ","p.m","half past","quarter","meet at","10","11","9.30","ten","eleven"]],["Öğle yemeğine gelemeyeceğini ve nedenini söyle",["because","can't","cannot","afraid","sorry","unfortunately"]]],"min":80,"max":130,"model":"Hi Alex,\nThanks for your email – it's great news that you've joined a sports club! I'd love to come with you on Saturday.\nI'd prefer to go swimming, because I haven't played tennis for years and I'm not very good at it. Swimming is also more relaxing.\nThe club opens at 9, but I have to take my little brother to his football match first. Shall we meet at half past ten outside the club?\nI'm afraid I can't have lunch with you after that, because my grandparents are visiting us and my mum wants me to be at home by one o'clock. Maybe we can have lunch next time?\nSee you on Saturday!\nDeniz"},{"id":"b1w2","part":1,"t":"E-posta: Okul gezisi","in":"Read this email from your English teacher Mrs Brown and the notes you have made. Write your email to Mrs Brown using all the notes.","mail":"From: Mrs Brown\nSubject: Class trip\n\nDear students,\nNext month our class will go on a day trip. [Yes, I'd like to go]\nWe can visit either the science museum or the zoo. Which do you think the class would enjoy more? [Say which and why]\nWe also need to decide how to travel. [Suggest ...]\nIs there anything else you would like to do on the trip? [Tell Mrs Brown]\nBest wishes,\nMrs Brown","pts":[["Geziye katılmak istediğini söyle",["like to","love to","would like","excited","looking forward","great idea","join"]],["Müze mi hayvanat bahçesi mi, nedeniyle söyle",["museum","zoo"]],["Ulaşım önerisi yap",["bus","train","coach","car","walk","travel by","go by"]],["Gezide yapmak istediğin başka bir şeyi söyle",["also","picnic","photos","shop","lunch","park","visit","would like to"]]],"min":80,"max":130,"model":"Dear Mrs Brown,\nThank you for your email. I would really like to go on the class trip – it sounds like a great idea!\nI think the class would enjoy the science museum more than the zoo. Most of us went to the zoo last year, and the museum has a new space exhibition with lots of interactive activities.\nI suggest that we travel by train, because the station is near the school and it is cheaper than hiring a coach.\nAlso, it would be nice to have a picnic in the park next to the museum at lunchtime, if the weather is good.\nBest wishes,\nAyşe"},{"id":"b1w3","part":2,"kind":"article","t":"Makale: Boş zaman","in":"You see this announcement on an English-language website for teenagers. Write your article in about 100 words.","mail":"ARTICLES WANTED!\nMy favourite way to spend free time\nWhat do you enjoy doing in your free time? Why do you enjoy it? Is it better to spend free time alone or with other people?\nThe best articles will appear on our website.","pts":[["Ne yaptığını anlat",["enjoy","love","like","favourite","spend"]],["Neden sevdiğini açıkla",["because","so","reason","makes me","helps me"]],["Yalnız mı başkalarıyla mı, görüşünü söyle",["alone","with friends","with other","others","on my own","together"]],["Bir başlık kullan",["@title"]]],"min":80,"max":140,"model":"Music: the best way to relax\nIn my free time, I love playing the guitar. I started when I was twelve, and now I practise almost every day after school.\nI enjoy it because it helps me forget about exams and homework. When I play a song well, I feel really proud of myself.\nSome people think hobbies are better with friends, but I think it depends on the hobby. I usually practise alone because I need to concentrate. However, at weekends I play with two friends in a small band, and that is the most fun of all. So, for me, the answer is both!"},{"id":"b1w4","part":2,"kind":"article","t":"Makale: Teknoloji ve okul","in":"You see this announcement in an English-language magazine for students. Write your article in about 100 words.","mail":"ARTICLES WANTED!\nShould students use phones in class?\nDo you use technology at school? How does it help you? Are there any problems with using phones in class?\nWrite an article answering these questions.","pts":[["Okulda teknoloji kullanımını anlat",["use","tablet","computer","phone","laptop","internet"]],["Faydasını açıkla",["help","useful","easier","quickly","find information"]],["Sorunlarını söyle",["problem","however","but","distract","cheat","games","social media"]],["Bir başlık kullan",["@title"]]],"min":80,"max":140,"model":"Phones in class: friend or enemy?\nAt my school, we often use tablets in lessons, and sometimes our teachers let us use our phones to look things up.\nTechnology helps us in many ways. For example, we can find information quickly, watch short videos about science and practise English with apps.\nHowever, there are also problems. Some students play games or check social media instead of listening to the teacher. Phones can also make it easier to cheat in tests.\nIn my opinion, phones are useful if teachers have clear rules. Without rules, they cause more problems than they solve."},{"id":"b1w5","part":2,"kind":"story","t":"Hikâye: Beklenmedik telefon","in":"Your English teacher has asked you to write a story. Your story must begin with this sentence. Write your story in about 100 words.","mail":"Your story must begin with this sentence:\nWhen the phone rang at midnight, Sam knew something was wrong.","pts":[["Verilen cümleyle başla",["when the phone rang at midnight"]],["Geçmiş zamanla olayları anlat",["was","were","went","said","told","saw","had"]],["Bir sorun ve çözüm olsun",["but","suddenly","then","finally","in the end","luckily"]],["Hikâyeyi bitir (sonuç)",["in the end","finally","at last","never","happy","relieved","home"]]],"min":80,"max":140,"model":"When the phone rang at midnight, Sam knew something was wrong. It was his sister, Lily, and she sounded worried.\n\"My car has broken down on the mountain road,\" she said. \"It's dark and my phone battery is almost dead.\"\nSam jumped out of bed, put on his coat and drove towards the mountains. It was raining heavily and he could hardly see the road. After forty minutes, he finally saw a small light by the side of the road. Lily was sitting in her car, cold but safe.\nThey drove home together, and in the end they laughed about the adventure over hot chocolate."},{"id":"b1w6","part":2,"kind":"story","t":"Hikâye: Kayıp anahtar","in":"Your English teacher has asked you to write a story. Your story must begin with this sentence. Write your story in about 100 words.","mail":"Your story must begin with this sentence:\nAs soon as Elif opened her bag, she realised the key was missing.","pts":[["Verilen cümleyle başla",["as soon as elif opened her bag"]],["Geçmiş zamanla olayları anlat",["was","were","went","looked","found","had","decided"]],["Bir sorun ve çözüm olsun",["but","suddenly","then","luckily","so"]],["Hikâyeyi bitir (sonuç)",["in the end","finally","at last","happy","relieved","laughed"]]],"min":80,"max":140,"model":"As soon as Elif opened her bag, she realised the key was missing. She was standing outside her flat, and her parents were on holiday for a week.\nShe tried to remember where she had been that day. She had gone to school, then to the library, and finally to a café with her friends.\nFirst, she called the café, but nobody had found a key. Then she went back to the library. Luckily, the librarian smiled and held up a small silver key. \"Is this yours?\" she asked.\nElif was so relieved that she bought the librarian a box of chocolates the next day."}],"S":[{"id":"b1s1","p":1,"t":"Part 1 · Kendini tanıt (1)","ins":"Examiner seni tanımak için kısa sorular soruyor. Her soruya 2–3 cümleyle cevap ver.","q":[["What's your name? Where do you live?",20,["my name is","i live in","i'm from"],"My name is Deniz and I live in Izmir, a big city on the west coast of Turkey. I've lived there all my life."],["Do you work or are you a student?",20,["i'm a student","i study","i work","at the moment"],"I'm a student. I'm in my last year at high school, and I'm studying for my university exams at the moment."],["What do you like doing in your free time?",20,["i like","i enjoy","in my free time","because"],"In my free time I enjoy playing basketball with my friends. I also like watching films at the weekend because it helps me relax."],["Tell us about your best friend.",25,["my best friend","we","known","since"],"My best friend is called Mert. We have known each other since primary school. He's very funny and always helps me when I have a problem."],["What did you do last weekend?",25,["last weekend","went","visited","watched"],"Last weekend I visited my grandparents in their village. We had a big family lunch and in the afternoon I went for a walk by the river."],["What are you going to do next summer?",25,["going to","i'd like","i hope","plan"],"Next summer I'm going to work in my uncle's shop for a month. After that I hope to go camping with my friends."]]},{"id":"b1s2","p":1,"t":"Part 1 · Kendini tanıt (2)","ins":"Examiner seni tanımak için kısa sorular soruyor. Her soruya 2–3 cümleyle cevap ver.","q":[["How do you usually travel to school or work?",20,["usually","by bus","on foot","takes"],"I usually go to school by bus. It takes about twenty minutes, but when the weather is nice I sometimes walk."],["What kind of music do you like?",20,["i like","favourite","because","listen"],"I like pop and rock music. My favourite band is Coldplay, and I listen to their songs when I'm studying."],["Tell us about your home.",25,["live in","flat","house","there is","there are"],"I live in a flat on the fourth floor with my parents and my sister. It isn't very big, but there is a balcony with a great view of the sea."],["What's your favourite food? Why?",20,["favourite","because","delicious","my mum"],"My favourite food is my mum's lentil soup. It's delicious and it always makes me feel better when I'm tired."],["Have you ever been to another country?",25,["have been","haven't been","never","last year","i'd like"],"Yes, I have. I went to Greece with my family two years ago. We stayed on an island for a week, and I'd love to go back one day."],["Is English important for you? Why?",25,["important","because","job","travel","future"],"Yes, it's very important. I want to study engineering, and many books are in English. It also helps me when I travel or play online games."]]},{"id":"b1s3","p":2,"t":"Part 2 · Konu kartı: Sevdiğin bir yer","ins":"PET'te bu bölümde bir fotoğrafı anlatırsın. Burada fotoğraf yerine konu kartı var: 1 dakika boyunca anlat.","q":[["Describe a place in your town where people like to spend time. Talk about where it is, what people do there, what you can see and hear, and why people like it.",60,["there is","there are","people are","in the middle","on the left","i can see","because","looks"],"One place I really like is the park near the sea in my town. It's in the centre, next to the old harbour. In the evenings it's always full of people. Some people are walking or running along the path, and children are playing on the grass. You can hear seagulls and sometimes musicians playing the guitar. On the left there are small cafés where people sit and drink tea. I think people like it because it's relaxing and you can see the sunset over the water. It's my favourite place to meet my friends."]]},{"id":"b1s4","p":2,"t":"Part 2 · Konu kartı: Kalabalık bir an","ins":"Fotoğraf yerine konu kartı: 1 dakika boyunca, sanki fotoğrafa bakıyormuş gibi anlat.","q":[["Imagine a photo of a busy train station. Describe the people, what they are doing, what they are wearing and how they might be feeling.",60,["in the picture","i can see","is wearing","are waiting","looks","might be","probably","in the background"],"In this picture I can see a busy train station, probably in the morning. In the front, a young man is running because he looks late for his train. He's wearing a suit and carrying a bag. Behind him, some people are waiting on the platform and looking at their phones. On the right, an old woman is sitting on a bench with her suitcase. She might be going to visit her family. In the background there is a big clock and a board with the train times. Everyone looks busy and a bit stressed, which is normal on a weekday morning."]]},{"id":"b1s5","p":3,"t":"Part 3 · Karar verme (tek başına)","ins":"PET'te bu bölüm bir partnerle yapılır. Burada iki tarafı da sen düşün: seçenekleri karşılaştır ve bir karar ver. 1 dakika.","q":[["A friend is moving to a new city and doesn't know anyone. Talk about these ideas and decide which one is the best way to make new friends: joining a sports club, taking an evening class, volunteering, using a social app, talking to neighbours.",60,["what about","i think","because","it would be","on the other hand","i agree","the best","let's"],"Let's think about the options. Joining a sports club is a good idea because you meet people regularly and do something healthy together. An evening class would be useful too, but people often go home straight after the lesson. Volunteering is great because you help others and meet kind people. On the other hand, a social app is quick but it can feel less real. Talking to neighbours is nice, but it might be difficult at first. In my opinion, the best choice is a sports club, because you see the same people every week and it's easy to start a conversation."]]},{"id":"b1s6","p":4,"t":"Part 4 · Tartışma soruları","ins":"Examiner konuyla ilgili görüşünü soruyor. Her soruya fikrini ve nedenini söyle.","q":[["Do you prefer spending time with a big group of friends or with one or two close friends? Why?",40,["i prefer","because","for example","in my opinion","it depends"],"I prefer spending time with one or two close friends. In a big group it's difficult to have a real conversation. For example, with my best friend I can talk about anything, and we understand each other well."],["Is it easier to make friends at school or online?",40,["i think","easier","because","however","on the other hand"],"I think it's easier to make friends online, because you can find people who like the same things as you. However, friends at school are usually closer, because you see them every day and share real experiences."],["How can people keep in touch with friends who live far away?",40,["can","video call","message","visit","for example"],"People can keep in touch in many ways. For example, they can send messages every day or have video calls at the weekend. It's also a good idea to visit each other in the holidays if possible."]]}]}}};
